  ["book.otbm.but_we_havent_give_up"] = "But we havent give up hope yet. Maybe we will find somehow someday by chance a key element that will help us to open many doors in the magic web.",
  ["book.otbm.but_when_the_orks_threatened"] = "But when the Orks threatened to cover Tibia almost completely, the dragon came! They had decided that only they",
