  ["book.otbm.dedicated_to_all_women_who"] = "Dedicated to all women who bravely and cleverly defeated the",
  ["book.otbm.deep_in_the_heart_of"] = "Deep in the heart of the Kha'labal the dreaded hyena king has its lair. This legendary beast is much larger than any other specimen of its race, surpassing lions and even elephants in size, and it can tear a man apart in seconds with its enormous, razor-sharp teeth. What's more, the hyena king is said to be truly immortal, for it has been sighted time and again by numerous travellers and merchants. Many a caravan is said to have fallen prey to this ferocious beast, and it is widely believed to have amassed untold treasures over the centuries.",
  ["book.otbm.describe_the_demonic_rulers"] = "describe the demonic rulers",
  ["book.otbm.desecration_this_entity_which_was"] = "desecration! This entity, which was two and one nevertheless, observed now the works of his companion in infinity.",
  ["book.otbm.destination_islands_senja_folda_vega"] = "Destination Islands: Senja, Folda, Vega",
  ["book.otbm.devised_dissolved_in_the_void"] = "devised dissolved in the void even before it was completed.",
  ["book.otbm.diary_of_hengis_wulfsonnni_can"] = "Diary of Hengis Wulfson\\n...\\nI can only hope I can escape the\\ncyclops someday. For now I have\\noccupied their chief with an attempt\\nto learn to read and write, but for\\nhow long?\\nI'm so desperate.\\nWhat a foolish idea to travel here to\\nsearch the famous treasures of this\\nancient, knightly order.\\nI wish I had never heard about it.\\nI wish I had never sung that song.\\nNo clue how many unfortunate souls I\\nhave lured to death with it.",
  ["book.otbm.died_but_i_could_make"] = "... died but I could make it to the throne. My wards are holding the howling ghosts and spectres at bay for now and I prepare to unleash the powers of the throne ...",
  ["book.otbm.different_to_the_clear_working"] = "different to the clear working of the Fardos, because mysteries and secrets were the aspects of his being. Uman and Zathroth",
  ["book.otbm.digging_not_a_single_trace"] = "Digging. Not a single trace of any door or even a window. Maybe home of some obscure cult of darkness? Maybe creatures of the night? A hideout for ghouls? Maybe I am working not hard enough. Hm, there seems to be a strange spot there at the wall, I can see it clearly from here. I shall try to push or pull it right away! Fame and riches, here I come!",
  ["book.otbm.diptrah_the_high_priest_master"] = "Diptrah the high priest, master of the mind, wielder of secret powers, keeper of the oldest of rituals.",
