  ["book.otbm.i_discovered_in_the_ancient"] = "I discovered in the ancient scrolls of my",
  ["book.otbm.i_dont_think_the_dream"] = "I don't think the Dream Challenge is too difficult.",
  ["book.otbm.i_have_collected_the_few"] = "I have collected the few information we have from the past and tried to reconstruate the birth of this city:",
  ["book.otbm.i_have_no_clue_how"] = "I have no clue how to trick the infamous Hugo but there has to be a way! Perhaps alchemy is the key to success. I will mix these two potions I bought from the travelling dwarf. We'll see what is going to happen. Perhaps it makes me invulnerable to the deadly breath! Then the secrets of the Nightmare Knights are at my grasp.",
  ["book.otbm.i_have_not_the_heart"] = "I have not the heart to tell it our remaining",
  ["book.otbm.i_have_to_find_them"] = "I have to find them or figure out the secret",
  ["book.otbm.i_know_that_hugo_lurks"] = "I know that Hugo lurks somewhere in the bushes in the North. I won't survive his deadly breath which would kill even the mightiest warrior!",
  ["book.otbm.i_lost_my_key_to"] = "I lost my key to the crypts below while I was fishing in the port. This is especially bad because those trolls hid my precious trumpet somewhere down there.",
  ["book.otbm.i_only_buy_fresh_corpses"] = "I only buy fresh corpses of rats, rabbits and wolves, as well as bear paws, wolf paws and minotaur",
  ["book.otbm.i_overheared_the_greenskined_brutes"] = "I overheared the greenskined brutes. 'charach' (or so) one said and the other responded the same way, then they began to chat in their strange language, certainly talking about some gruesome plot against mankind. Talking they wandered away and after they vanished from my view I quickly got up and headed to Thais as fast as I could.",
  ["book.otbm.i_see_the_sorcerer_said"] = "\"I see\" the sorcerer said, \"that this bridge will break down and fall into the water within 60 minutes. So we have to hurry up. It will only hold two of us at the same time and it is a long bridge. The wounded knight will need 25 minutes to go over the bridge, and it will take me 20. The paladin can go faster, so he will be on the other side within 10 minutes.\"",
  ["book.otbm.i_sell_bread_cheese_ham"] = "I sell bread, cheese, ham, and meat.",
  ["book.otbm.i_stopped_counting_the_days"] = "I stopped counting the days, because I lost all feeling for time down here.",
  ["book.otbm.i_tarberi_of_house_of"] = "I, Tarberi of House of Winter, hereby pledge my services to the Lord of... (the rest of the document is stained and burnt)",
  ["book.otbm.i_think_i_found_out"] = "I think I found out some coordinates for the Island Dianscher.",
