  ["book.otbm.if_the_first_stage_has"] = "* If the first stage has been completed successfully, a bridge is built south of Cormaya after a certain amount of time.",
  ["book.otbm.if_the_first_stage_has_a944a6f8"] = "* If the first stage has been completed successfully, a bridge is built south of Cormaya after a certain amount of time.",
  ["book.otbm.if_the_suspect_claims_that"] = "If the suspect claims that he has no trouble at all, ask him if he thinks that the lack of trouble is explained by the FORESIGHT of the AUTHORITIES. If he denies, he is to be observed for heretical tendencies. If he agrees, ask him if he thinks that it is ALSO for the GODS' will that he has no trouble. If he disagrees, he is to be observed for heretical tendencies. If the subject does not show any suspicious b haviour at this point, ask him if he thinks that any TROUBLE will arise in the near FUTURE. If he negates, he obviously will become lax in the line of his duty and he is to be observed for heretical tendencies. If he confirms that trouble might arise, continue as in paragraph II.",
  ["book.otbm.if_we_release_the_power"] = "If we release the power of the might rings without being able to control it, then this power will destroy our whole city immediatly.",
  ["book.otbm.if_you_are_near_an"] = "If you are near an NPC, you can talk with him or her by clicking on or typing 'hi' or 'hello'. Most NPCs will show you a",
  ["book.otbm.if_you_are_no_dwarf"] = "If you are no dwarf don't even try to think that you have a chance of mastering the art of tunnelling. If you are a dwarf I wish you good luck and don't abandon faith. There is a light at the end of the tunnel.",
  ["book.otbm.if_you_are_wise_enough"] = "If you are wise enough, you may leave this isle and explore the great continent of Tibia. Once you are at level 8",
  ["book.otbm.if_you_want_distance_weapons"] = "If you want distance weapons or ammunition, come on up. I'm busy protecting the city!",
