  ["book.otbm.library_and_upper_armoury"] = "Library and Upper Armoury",
  ["book.otbm.life_without_all_magic_on"] = "life, without all magic, on a tiny island, deserted and almost devoid of life ... and nevertheless full of age-old secrets. And soon",
  ["book.otbm.lilys_shop_buy_potions_or"] = "Lily's shop - Buy potions or sell your cookies and blueberries!",
  ["book.otbm.lilys_shop_potions_for_everyone"] = "Lily's shop - Potions for everyone!",
  ["book.otbm.living_quarters_and_mushroom_gardens"] = "Living Quarters And Mushroom Gardens",
  ["book.otbm.logs_and_leaks_the_daily"] = "Logs and Leaks, the Daily Life of a Captain",
  ["book.otbm.look_at_the_4_and"] = "look at the 4 and ignore the 2",
  ["book.otbm.lower_areas_access_denied"] = "Lower Areas - Access Denied!",
  ["book.otbm.magic_and_potion_research_lab"] = "Magic and Potion Research Lab",
  ["book.otbm.magic_chalk_charm_it_with"] = "magic chalk (charm it with the spell of spirit-binding first!)",
  ["book.otbm.magic_is_life_life_is"] = "Magic is Life, Life is Magic. Well, life is sex too, but this is a book for little children, so we wont talk about that here. But never forget that Magic is a jealous Lady and if you try to take her out of your head she will sure take revenge.",
  ["book.otbm.magical_powers_and_hurled_a"] = "magical powers and hurled a major part of the fire far away from himself. From the fire, which did not want to cool down,",
  ["book.otbm.mahardis_the_mage_a_pyromaniacal"] = "Mahardis the mage, a pyromaniacal madman who fooled the princes of elemental fire to steal the secrets of the flame.",
  ["book.otbm.mail_room_depot_stores_bank"] = "Mail Room, Depot, Stores, Bank",
  ["book.otbm.man_is_a_rope_funambulating"] = "\"Man is a rope, funambulating between the animals and the gods.\" -  Tarrakosther Nimbos.",
  ["book.otbm.manifest_of_the_yalahari_part"] = "Manifest of the Yalahari, Part I",
  ["book.otbm.manifest_of_the_yalahari_part_41b75d31"] = "Manifest of the Yalahari, Part II",
  ["book.otbm.many_are_the_legends_concerning"] = "Many are the legends concerning Gha'Zuul",
  ["book.otbm.may_banor_bless_our_souls"] = "May Banor bless our souls.",
  ["book.otbm.may_crunor_protect_our_health"] = "May Crunor protect our health and essence.",
  ["book.otbm.may_fardos_give_us_the"] = "May Fardos give us the force of will to forge our souls to tools of good.",
  ["book.otbm.may_it_flourish_and_grow"] = "May it flourish and grow.",
  ["book.otbm.may_the_archangels_guide_and"] = "May the archangels guide and guard us.",
  ["book.otbm.may_the_kiss_of_kirok"] = "May the kiss of Kirok bring us inspiration.",
  ["book.otbm.may_uman_teach_us_to"] = "May Uman teach us to use his gifts and to use them wisely.",
  ["book.otbm.maybe_one_day_we_can"] = "Maybe one day we can just teleport into the magic web and stay there. I would love to investigate it.",
  ["book.otbm.meanwhile_the_gruesome_children_of"] = "Meanwhile the gruesome children of the dark gods raged more and more savagely, and the devastation of the world",
  ["book.otbm.meeting_every_day_at_5"] = "Meeting every day at 5 pm.",
  ["book.otbm.mehrah_asram_cha_mehe_than"] = "Mehrah asram cha mehe than. Uth a'thul at cha there. Orum tha cha elik jahara. Udhun zah fahr mal. Chamek at uthul hatradek asram. Mehrem alir iktha at uthun. Kasin tha Ur ch helim doh. Mah dah direm. Athul as hathu, athul as dofah, athul as mereth. Cha ukhtu muhn dahra. Sethor mah amin dah. At meruhm cha me dah. Chamek persim kaharah bah tufi. Moh dah rah. Moh Udhin cha uthul. Meheth Zuhl tha berah.",
  ["book.otbm.memo_need_more_diverse_specimen"] = "Memo: need more diverse specimen samples and further trials of bone dust dosage in Carpeyr'Fuatha rite. Running short on female mammals. Memo: Ask head priestess for more virgin subjects. Question: different heat/ combustion method needed? Alternative to lava pit? Place query with head skull builder.",
  ["book.otbm.memorial_of_the_sunken_quarter"] = "Memorial of the Sunken Quarter",
  ["book.otbm.mermaids_are_vain_creatures_of"] = "Mermaids are vain creatures of magical nature. Dealings with mermaids are dangerous to some extent. Many men have fallen in love with one of them, bewitched by their beauty and magic. Fortunately, mermaids are easily distracted and lose any interest in their enthralled victims as soon as something or someone else draws their attention. Since this is often enough another man that was foolish enough to get close to them, one elflock-stricken victim is replaced with another one. It is almost impossible to escape this vicious circle since unbanning one victim often means to sacrifice another man's life or at least his freedom.",
  ["book.otbm.mill_opened_day_and_night"] = "Mill opened day and night. If I'm at my home during night time, feel free to put the mill to use by yourself instead. Enjoy! - Evrard",
  ["book.otbm.minotaur_cheese_is_a_specialty"] = "Minotaur cheese is a specialty, often envied by decadent human nobles.",
  ["book.otbm.mission_teleporter_crystal_grounds"] = "Mission Teleporter Crystal Grounds",
  ["book.otbm.mission_teleporter_golem_workshop"] = "Mission Teleporter Golem Workshop",
  ["book.otbm.mission_teleporter_hot_spot"] = "Mission Teleporter Hot Spot",
  ["book.otbm.mission_teleporter_truffels_garden"] = "Mission Teleporter Truffels Garden",
  ["book.otbm.mixture_of_sulphorous_steam_and"] = "Mixture of sulphorous steam and troll urine exploded upon shaking. Wall should be replaced.",
  ["book.otbm.morguthis_the_neverdefeated_general_a"] = "Morguthis, the never-defeated general. A lethal and merciless warrior consumed by irrepressible rage.",
  ["book.otbm.most_monsters_are_far_more"] = "Most monsters are far more dangerous when you're attacked by more of them. Keep in mind that no more than two enemy attacks can be blocked at a time. Use this to your advantage and attack single monsters with help of other heroes. Don't get surrounded by monsters, that might be your death even if the monsters are not that powerful.",
  ["book.otbm.most_of_these_invasions_could"] = "Most of these invasions could be tracked to some unholy centre of magic. From there immense forces were evoked to open a gate through which the demonic armies entered our world.",
  ["book.otbm.most_pirates_started_their_career"] = "Most pirates started their career as smugglers and reavers at the beaches. With the help of small shipping boats, they boarded ships in remote bays where they restocked supplies. Often whole villages made a living from such acts of banditry. At some point they decided that they had become strong enough to take over the ships and raid the seas. Another source of pirates were the mutinous crews that took over ships and who were hunted by the navy anyways.",
  ["book.otbm.most_powerful_of_the_ancients"] = "most powerful of the Ancients were hurled out of this world by the good Gods for their betrayal to suffer eternally in the sphere,",
  ["book.otbm.mother_burned_only_deep_inside"] = "mother burned only deep inside of him. There however the fire became more ravaging and more hurting, and the rough titan",
  ["book.otbm.much_youve_already_deposited"] = "much you've already deposited.",
  ["book.otbm.mumification_a_case_study"] = "Mumification, a case study",
  ["book.otbm.mushroom_fields_downstairs"] = "Mushroom Fields Downstairs",
  ["book.otbm.mushrooms_come_in_many_different"] = "Mushrooms come in many different colors and shapes, at least ten different kinds are known.",
  ["book.otbm.my_offers_are_lyre_lute"] = "My offers are lyre, lute, drum, and simple fanfare.",
  ["book.otbm.mysterious_way_it_created_this"] = "mysterious way it created this entity. In any event, suddenly the enormous entity Tibiasula rose from the void and examined the two other godly beings. Fardos and Uman welcomed Tibiasula as their sister and admired her, because she was the perfect unity of the elements. Zathroth however fumed with silent hate, as he didn't want to share the void with one more entity.",
  ["book.otbm.mystic_of_gate_souls_from"] = "mystic of gate souls from planes of existence far, far away of Tibia could be called in order to assume the shape of heroes.",
  ["book.otbm.name_or_ask_about_their"] = "name or ask about their job. Just try it out!",
  ["book.otbm.nargor_is_a_hostile_rock"] = "Nargor is a hostile rock surrounded by treacherous reefs. Since it is uninhabitable and almost unreachable it is of no interest.",
  ["book.otbm.nargor_is_a_hostile_rock_6eaadd68"] = "Nargor is a hostile rock surrounded by treacherous reefs. Since it is uninhabitable and almost unreachable it is of no interest.",
  ["book.otbm.natural_toxins_and_venoms_in"] = "Natural toxins and venoms in the Darashian desert. Revised version, by Dark Priestess Hyllissa Wolfsbane.",
  ["book.otbm.necromancer_halls_directions"] = "Necromancer Halls - Directions:",
  ["book.otbm.necromancy_a_philosophical_essay_by"] = "Necromancy, a Philosophical Essay, by the Dark Brother Alonso de Iverra",
  ["book.otbm.necromants_nectar_is_crucial_to"] = "'necromants nectar' is crucial to",
  ["book.otbm.never_again_i_will_wear"] = "Never again I will wear that fancy armor and black shall be the color of my revenge.",
  ["book.otbm.never_enter_dungeons_without_a"] = "Never enter dungeons without a rope or you may be lost forever.",
  ["book.otbm.never_enter_dungeons_without_a_4f479d0e"] = "Never enter dungeons without a rope or you may be lost forever.",
  ["book.otbm.new_we_are_now_exchanging"] = "NEW - we are now exchanging coins!",
  ["book.otbm.next_ask_him_if_he"] = "Next, ask him if he thinks that the AUTHORITIES will handle the subject that troubles him. If he states that the authorities will solve the trouble, ask him if he thinks that they could have AVOIDED the trouble in the first place. If he confirms that the trouble could have been avoided, he is to be observed for heretical tendencies. If the suspect has yet not shown any heretic opinion, ask him why he thinks that the GODS would ALLOW that such things are happening. If he claims that he doesn't know, it is implied that he doubts this godly decision and is to be observed for heretical tendencies. If he comes up with an explanation that suggests that the gods lack the power to prevent that such a thing happens, than he is to be observed for heretical tendencies as well. If he answers that only the gods know the answer or that the gods had some plausible reason, like testing humanity, he may have no heretical tendencies at all.",
  ["book.otbm.no_blood_priest_and_especially"] = "No blood priest, and especially Tomruk The Ruddy is not to be let in, under any pretenses, again!",
  ["book.otbm.no_entrance_room_under_investigation"] = "No entrance! Room under investigation.",
  ["book.otbm.no_more_business_only_show"] = "No more business, only show business!",
  ["book.otbm.no_one_knows_where_they"] = "No one knows where they really come from. It seems the murderous quara are living deep down in the ocean in unknown numbers. From there, they plot their raids on the surface in which they cause havoc and mayhem. The quara consist of several subspecies whose relation to each other is still unknown to men. Given their hostile disposition, it is unlikely that we will ever learn more about them. For most humans it is sufficient to know that a quara means danger. Those who are able to fight them should kill them, those who are too weak should avoid them by all means.",
  ["book.otbm.no_one_knows_where_they_b0a25b58"] = "No one knows where they really come from. It seems the murderous quara are living deep down in the ocean in unknown numbers. From there, they plot their raids on the surface in which they cause havoc and mayhem. The quara consist of several subspecies whose relation to each other is still unknown to men. Given their hostile disposition, it is unlikely that we will ever learn more about them. For most humans it is sufficient to know that a quara means danger. Those who are able to fight them should kill them, those who are too weak should avoid them by all means.",
