  ["book.otbm.of_kirok_which_one_would"] = "of Kirok, which one would call the crazy one. Kirok was from precipitous, scizophrenic nature. On the one hand he was",
  ["book.otbm.of_your_own_in_which"] = "of your own in which you can spend the night.",
