  ["book.otbm.oh_how_i_long_to"] = "Oh, how I long to see humans again!",
  ["book.otbm.omark_ikem_goshak_ba_batuk"] = "Omark ikem goshak ba batuk",
  ["book.otbm.on_a_remote_isle_in"] = "On a remote isle in the South there is a grotto where all witches come together to celebrate some demonic festivity once a year. They teach each other new malicious",
  ["book.otbm.on_a_remote_isle_in_1075895d"] = "On a remote isle in the South there is a grotto where all witches come together to celebrate some demonic festivity once a year. They teach each other new malicious",
  ["book.otbm.on_as_druids_for_the"] = "on as druids for the forces of the life. Together with the godly world tree Crunor they created many of the creatures, that",
  ["book.otbm.on_my_own_i_will"] = "on my own. I will never share my secrets and the success with the brotherhood, but now",
  ["book.otbm.on_one_of_the_isles"] = "On one of the isles I witnessed an utmost unusual occurrence.",
  ["book.otbm.on_one_of_the_isles_c4f4d602"] = "On one of the isles I witnessed an utmost unusual occurrence.",
  ["book.otbm.on_the_mainland_is_the"] = "On the mainland is the city of Thais, ruled by the wise and just King Tibianus. His explorers found the new soulvortex on this isle and build this base to protect and train the incoming heroes.",
  ["book.otbm.on_the_request_of_our"] = "On the request of our beloved pharaoh we have stopped the research on the XXXXXX spell. All research was destroyed, and although we had met with considerable success in XXXXX the XXXXX and even seemed to have a solution for the problem of the plasma leak the project has been discarded. Even the side reports were destroyed. An apology has been issued to the pharaoh for thoughtlessly researching in that field.",
  ["book.otbm.on_those_who_try_the"] = "on those who try the ascension.",
  ["book.otbm.on_those_who_try_the_2a6b8e93"] = "on those who try the ascension.",
  ["book.otbm.once_again_battle_the_forces"] = "once again battle the forces of evil; and a new",
  ["book.otbm.once_in_the_olden_days"] = "Once in the olden days, the beholderkin numbered among the most powerful races of the world. Their mighty cities, which characteristically contained ominous dark pyramids, could be found all over the world. The beholders erected them using the same innate form of telekinesis which lets their bodies float in the air. However, they could not do completely without hands and arms that did their bidding. For this reason they relied on another innate power of their race - the dark power of necromancy. Thanks to the magical abilities of their eye stalks, which are capable of producing various powerful kinds of magic to an extent that is denied to other races unless they study for many decades, the beholders also knew how to command the dead. As a result, they used a monstrous strategy: Whenever they conquered an area they turned their unfortunate victims into undead slaves. Using these undead legions as their shock troops, the beholders went from victory to victory. They built a huge fortress that served as their power base, and from there they went to conquer the world.",
  ["book.otbm.once_the_gate_is_open"] = "Once the gate is open, demonic minions appear and boost the negative energy of the place by their sheer presence. Later, the demonic master is following. His appearance causes a drop of the negative energy as the demon lord is feeding on it to sustain his existence in our realm.",
  ["book.otbm.once_they_are_slain_they"] = "* Once they are slain, they can be looted for a vital ingredient which should be given to one of the bakers at the cake extractor machines.",
  ["book.otbm.once_they_are_slain_they_cd08c61b"] = "* Once they are slain, they can be looted for a vital ingredient which should be given to one of the bakers at the cake extractor machines.",
  ["book.otbm.once_upon_a_time_there"] = "Once upon a time there was a little gnome.",
  ["book.otbm.once_upon_a_time_there_39f27220"] = "Once upon a time, there have been a knight, a druid, a paladin and a sorcerer that survived the great battle upon the fields of glory. Some of them were wounded, some not. All were deadly tired. They had to escape from a hord of orcs, a whole tribe with more then 35 fighters. Late in the night, they came to a huge bridge, or at least the rest of a once mighty bridge. It was small and seemed to be not very save. The sorcerer screamed some loud and mighty words and for a second the bridge glew in a blue light.",
  ["book.otbm.one_specimen_was_lost_in"] = "One specimen was lost in that experiment. The others were salvaged in different states of sunburn and began to regenerate.",
  ["book.otbm.only_enter_with_adequately_warm"] = "Only enter with adequately warm clothing!",
  ["book.otbm.only_experienced_adventurers_are_allowed"] = "Only experienced adventurers are allowed to leave the village.",
  ["book.otbm.only_experienced_adventurers_should_proceed"] = "Only experienced adventurers should proceed!",
  ["book.otbm.only_experienced_adventurers_should_proceed_c92839da"] = "Only experienced adventurers should proceed from here.",
  ["book.otbm.only_honorary_barbarians_may_become"] = "Only honorary barbarians may become inhabitants of Svargrond!",
  ["book.otbm.only_premium_citizens_may_pass"] = "Only premium citizens may pass.",
  ["book.otbm.only_premium_citizens_may_pass_31b94383"] = "Only premium citizens may pass.",
  ["book.otbm.only_the_humble_may_touch"] = "Only the humble may touch the Sword of Fury",
  ["book.otbm.only_those_adept_at_targeting"] = "Only those adept at targeting and aiming can put it to proper use.",
  ["book.otbm.only_those_skilled_in_magic"] = "Only those skilled in magic can put it to proper use.",
  ["book.otbm.only_those_standing_strong_and"] = "Only those standing strong and fighting powerfully can put it to proper use.",
  ["book.otbm.only_true_believers_may_enter"] = "Only true believers may enter",
  ["book.otbm.only_with_drastic_decisions_and"] = "Only with drastic decisions and changes, this great goal can be achieved. We will have to get through hard times and prepare for them as good as we can. Most importantly, a good city needs a solid base. For this reason we have to start at the bottom to clean things up. We have to be precise and consequent in our decisions and actions. This way we will be able to create a solid base for the city.",
  ["book.otbm.orange_star_stella_flava"] = "Orange Star (stella flava)",
  ["book.otbm.orcish_hordes_and_saved_carlin"] = "orcish hordes and saved Carlin from destruction.",
  ["book.otbm.orcs_are_intelligent_though_some"] = "Orcs ARE intelligent. Though some dwarfes mumble about a shared hivemind of the greenskins, there is no evidence for that. Orcs have speech and are capable to learn other humanoids language quite well ... if they want, what almost never is the case. They lack a written language though. Some of the more educated orcs use human letters to write down orcish texts. It's rumored that the orcs we encounter now and then are just barbarians of their own kind and that there is a more 'civilized' orcish culture somewhere. There are some clues that the orcs indeed had a written language, but the modern orcs are unable to read it as we are.",
  ["book.otbm.orruk_ahtanri_anvi_ra_shuk"] = "Orruk ah'tanri, anvi ra shuk ta",
  ["book.otbm.oshkulc_parr_ak_ktis_kandushta"] = "Oshkulc parr ak k'tis, kandushta marrikto",
  ["book.otbm.other_creatures_brog_was_fascinated"] = "other creatures. Brog was fascinated by this created being and its terrible children, although they showed him neither loyalty nor",
  ["book.otbm.ottokars_hospital_for_the_poor"] = "Ottokar's Hospital for the Poor and Afflicted. All donations welcome!",
  ["book.otbm.our_ancients_got_somehow_some"] = "Our ancients got somehow some might rings.",
  ["book.otbm.our_ancients_used_their_mighty"] = "Our ancients used their mighty magical power to control the lava down here. With the help of our loyal trolls, they somehow build this city.",
  ["book.otbm.our_army_is_nott_sleeping"] = "Our army is nott sleeping",
  ["book.otbm.our_goal_is_to_research"] = "Our goal is to research into the magic web of our world and to control it, so we can finally reach our purpose: the immortality.",
  ["book.otbm.our_main_task_is_to"] = "Our main task is to find this secret place of the Ruthless Seven and to kill the lieutenants there. Finally, the doomsday device has to be destroyed.",
  ["book.otbm.our_progress_is_very_good"] = "Our progress is very good! If we continue like that and without any problems then we will be able to close the investigations on the wand of might within 1 year!",
  ["book.otbm.our_sources_are_highly_reliable"] = "Our sources are highly reliable. The Ruthless Seven have deployed some of their most powerful lieutenants to ensure the success of their mission. Strangely, the things we read in the minds of these lieutenants did not point to the Plains of Havoc as expected but to the remote isle of Edron.",
  ["book.otbm.our_studies_on_the_source"] = "Our studies on the source of our dreams are not conclusive. The elves are no help in this matter. I doubt they even understand what we are asking them about because their dreams are so different from ours that there are almost no similarities.",
  ["book.otbm.our_wise_and_noble_leader"] = "Our wise and noble leader",
  ["book.otbm.our_world_of_tibia_is"] = "Our world of Tibia is filled with various kinds of magic. Until now, we dont know much about this magic. Only a small part of the whole magic power is under our control.",
  ["book.otbm.out_by_the_hand_of"] = "out by the hand of time soon.",
  ["book.otbm.path_to_the_gardens_of"] = "Path to the Gardens Of Night. Tread with care, pilgrim. The Dark One listens for you.",
