  ["book.otbm.possibility_of_becoming_similar_to"] = "possibility of becoming similar to Banor, uniting power and cunning. Thus the hordes of undead and their terrible leaders were",
  ["book.otbm.potions_can_be_handed_out"] = "Potions can be handed out. There have been no reported cases of overdosing.",
