  ["book.otbm.use_the_pick_on_stone"] = "Use the Pick on stone for pass there.",
  ["book.otbm.useful_things_furniture_instruments_tools"] = "Useful Things - Furniture, Instruments, Tools, Papers",
  ["book.otbm.useful_things_furniture_instruments_tools_61076f0d"] = "Useful Things - Furniture, Instruments, Tools, Papers",
  ["book.otbm.using_invisibility_and_other_magic"] = "Using invisibility and other magic, they remain unseen most of the time. But be warned, if you antagonise the klabauterman of a ship, his harmless pranks will turn dangerous.",
  ["book.otbm.using_invisibility_and_other_magic_498be678"] = "Using invisibility and other magic, they remain unseen most of the time. But be warned, if you antagonise the klabauterman of a ship, his harmless pranks will turn dangerous.",
  ["book.otbm.valid_post_addresses_are_abdendriel"] = "Valid post addresses are Ab'Dendriel, Thais, Carlin, Kazordoon, Venore, Edron, Ankrahmun, Port Hope, Svargrond, Liberty Bay, Yalahar and Darashia.",
  ["book.otbm.valid_post_addresses_are_thais"] = "Valid post addresses are Thais, Carlin, Venore, Kazordoon, Ab'Dendriel, Edron, Ankrahmun, Port Hope, Darashia, Liberty Bay, Yalahar and Svargrond.",
  ["book.otbm.valid_post_addresses_are_thais_60377ba4"] = "Valid post addresses are Thais, Carlin, Venore, Kazordoon, Ab'Dendriel, Edron, Ankrahmun, Port Hope, Darashia, Svargrond, Yalahar and Liberty Bay.",
  ["book.otbm.valid_post_addresses_are_thais_8e3321ce"] = "Valid post addresses are Thais, Carlin, Venore, Kazordoon, Ab'Dendriel, Edron, Ankrahmun, Port Hope, Darashia, Liberty Bay, Yalahar and Svargrond.",
  ["book.otbm.vashresamuns_chorus_lane"] = "Vashresamun's Chorus Lane",
  ["book.otbm.venore_main_road_western_city"] = "Venore Main Road. Western City Gate ahead. All Visitors Welcome!",
  ["book.otbm.very_basic_rituals_depend_on"] = "Very basic rituals depend on the influences of dawn and dusk, or of night and day. Other, more complex rituals may only be performed at very specific times, perhaps even at a specific hour. Other rituals that are more complex still are bound to specific days, and to specific times as well. In fact, some individual spells can only be performed once a year or once every other year, while the most powerful of rituals may only be carried out during stellar constellations that are so incredibly rare that centuries may pass before the ritual can be performed again. Given the power and knowledge of the ancients it seems reasonable to assume that they have prepared rituals whose time has not even come to this very day. Since most of the ancient races have disappeared from the lands it is well possible that some of the rituals are still be buried in some long forgotten ruin, while others might actually be in the possession of some surviving heir of one of the ancient races.",
  ["book.otbm.very_evil_and_probably_smelly"] = "Very Evil And Probably Smelly Big Guy",
  ["book.otbm.very_good_and_nice_small"] = "Very Good And Nice Small Guy!",
  ["book.otbm.virgin_preferably_female_and_young"] = "- Virgin, preferably female and young for the best taste",
  ["book.otbm.virtue_as_combat_and_magical"] = "virtue as combat and magical powers. And she became the first of the noble paladins. Until our times the leader of the paladins",
  ["book.otbm.waiting_to_spread_chaos_over"] = "waiting to spread chaos over the world. Already the dragons sharpened their talons on their rock, in order to rise again into air",
  ["book.otbm.warehouse_of_abran_ironeye"] = "Warehouse of Abran Ironeye",
  ["book.otbm.warehouse_of_abran_ironeye_4c3c466b"] = "Warehouse of Abran Ironeye",
  ["book.otbm.warehouse_of_leeland_slim"] = "Warehouse of Leeland Slim",
  ["book.otbm.warehouse_of_leeland_slim_e1870d40"] = "Warehouse of Leeland Slim",
  ["book.otbm.warehouse_of_talesia_demir"] = "Warehouse of Talesia De'Mir",
  ["book.otbm.warehouse_of_talesia_demir_0513d8f4"] = "Warehouse of Talesia De'Mir",
  ["book.otbm.warentrosa_base_de_edron"] = "War-Entrosa base de Edron",
  ["book.otbm.warentrosa_base_de_edron_52a0d1fb"] = "War-Entrosa base de Edron",
  ["book.otbm.warlord_rank_rewards_choose_wisely"] = "Warlord Rank Rewards - Choose wisely!",
  ["book.otbm.warning_monsters_down_the_hole"] = "WARNING! Monsters down the hole!",
  ["book.otbm.warning_only_sorcerers_are_allowed"] = "Warning! Only Sorcerers are allowed to pass.",
  ["book.otbm.wave_after_wave_of_undead"] = "Wave after wave of undead and Efreet stormed against Ankrahmun, and wave after wave broke at the huge fortifications of the ancient city. Both the Marid and the humans were well-prepared for this battle, and even though Malor's army wreaked havoc they never yielded.",
  ["book.otbm.way_to_the_mushroom_island"] = "Way to the mushroom island Talahu will only be granted to those who make the right sacrifice",
  ["book.otbm.we_always_possessed_the_power"] = "We always possessed the power to \"talk\" to the lava and to form/move it for our purposes.",
  ["book.otbm.we_are_aware_that_there"] = "We are aware that there are some ancient ruins north of Edron. Orshabaal, who is a powerful servant of the Ruthless Seven, might appear in this area to scare people away and to distract any attention.",
  ["book.otbm.we_are_going_to_build"] = "We are going to build a building at this building place",
  ["book.otbm.we_are_making_right_now"] = "We are making right now some experiments with several magic stuff and we hope that the wand of might will react to some of them somehow.",
  ["book.otbm.we_assume_that_the_last"] = "We assume that the last major eruption coincided with the destruction of the Nightmare Knights. Several earlier reports of increased demonic activity overlap with eruptions, too.",
  ["book.otbm.we_changed_this_remote_monastery"] = "We changed this remote monastery into a small fortress to guard our new secrets. There is much to learn and by now we only understand little of the secrets the elves have taught us. Our dreams are not bright and revitalising as the ones the elves told us about but full of dark omens. We have to learn how to interpret them adequately. The green plains in which we reside are sometimes dangerous. Therefore, we will soon allow fighters to join our group. Some suggested to form a formally order to further our cause. The conclave will discuss this in the next meeting.",
  ["book.otbm.we_confirm_that_the_ruthless"] = "We confirm that the Ruthless Seven have occupied the place which is known as Pits of Inferno. With the help of divination, we were able to see that they channelled their dark essence to some remote place in our world for unknown reasons. We could not figure out this place, though. It cannot be emphasised enough that it is extremely important to find this place and if possible, to destroy it.",
  ["book.otbm.we_dont_know_exactly_when"] = "We dont know exactly when this city was build.",
  ["book.otbm.we_dont_know_much_about"] = "We dont know much about the mighty leaders of the dragons. But we found out that they love mushrooms of all kind. Maybe the old dragonlord on Dracona can tell us more.",
  ["book.otbm.we_have_learnt_from_captured"] = "We have learnt from captured demon servants that the Ruthless Seven have occupied some new base and are preparing some kind of doomsday device there. It seems to be their intention to attack one of the major cities and to turn it into hell on earth.",
  ["book.otbm.we_have_stolen_the_key"] = "We have stolen the key to the large ancient temple hall under the city of Tibia. But the key is useless now, because the temple has been plundered by the humans. The temple is free, also for us, the trolls. The entrance is outside the human city.",
  ["book.otbm.we_have_to_assume_that"] = "We have to assume that the abilities and reactions of older vampires differ, either being increased or reduced.",
  ["book.otbm.we_havent_yet_managed_to"] = "We haven't yet managed to improve the 'find person' spell. However, we are still convinced that in theory it must be capable of divulging additional information such as the experience and power of the targeted persons as well as their general physical condition and the chemical composition of their last supper. There are numerous problems, though, and it is well possible that we have to start all over again. This would mean, of course, that we would have to create some spells to obtain information by means of magic which is plain to see when you are close to the targeted person. One might argue that it is a waste of time and resources to develop such a spell, but then I see no other way to create a similar spell that features enhanced range and a combination of effects.",
  ["book.otbm.we_lost_three_mages_in"] = "We lost three mages in our last attempt at performing a controlled demon summoning. It is still too difficult to predict in what way the fabric of time and space is affected by the breach of the sphere, and from what we have seen the backlash of nature against demonic incursion can range from a slightly offensive odour to a sizeable explosion such as the one we saw yesterday. I am personally disappointed to observe that the elemental protection spells we put up did not work at all. Perhaps there is some truth in the reports that the unleashed energy is of purely entropical nature. We have yet to decide whether or not it makes sense to create an entropic counterspell first, but I support the idea that the loss of manpower while trying to balance the spell is manageable. It is possible, though, that this will lead to no convincing result at all due to the uncontrollable nature of the demonic realm. If this should be the case the use of entropic countermagic is the only option left.",
  ["book.otbm.we_must_be_very_careful"] = "We must be very careful while we investigate those rings.",
  ["book.otbm.we_must_keep_our_standards"] = "We must keep our standards even in these times",
  ["book.otbm.we_offer_some_magic_spells"] = "We offer some magic spells for Paladins.",
  ["book.otbm.we_sell_nearly_everything_an"] = "We sell nearly everything an adventurer could need.",
  ["book.otbm.we_stood_on_a_plank"] = "...we stood on a plank and beneath us was a pit full of hissing snakes. Worse, the plank was pulled back into the wall, and there was no way out. If it hadn't been for our good Alil who had stayed out of that cursed chamber in a rare moment of clear-sightedness, we would all have ended up as snake food. Just how he managed to find that hidden lever on the statue is still beyond me.",
  ["book.otbm.we_the_families_of_the"] = "We, the families of the Augur, have been living here for many generations. In the course of time, we acquired certain insights in the ways of our masters, the Yalahari. Many years ago, things used to be very different in this city. Once it was a marvel to behold, but then it started to decay slowly and steadily. This process of deterioration begun in the far past, long before our ancestors came here. At the time they were brought here by the Yalahari as helpers and workers, the city already showed signs of decline. Despite their claim of having great power, the Yalahari could do little to stop the catastrophes that should occur. Neither did they do anything to restore the damaged parts of the city. Still, it took many centuries until the city had reached the pitiful state that you can witness today.",
  ["book.otbm.we_tracked_goshnars_daughter_to"] = "We tracked Goshnar's daughter to the gates of Carlin but lost her within the city. Of course we got no help by the 'authorities', so I think she could hide there somewhere. It's likely that the brotherhood of bones has agents in the city that gave her shelter. We think she doesn't know her father's secrets though. Her magic tricks seemed quite ordinary to us. I can't say whether the rumour that she is pregnant is true. If so, nothing is known about the father of this child. Considering that Goshnar was allied with darkness we must fear the worst. So the search for Fermubras continues.",
  ["book.otbm.we_will_kill_every_intruder"] = "We will kill every intruder - The Master Troll",
  ["book.otbm.we_will_otec_th_pla"] = "we will ..otec. th.. pla...",
  ["book.otbm.welcome_to_nordic_tibia_ferries"] = "Welcome to Nordic Tibia Ferries!",
  ["book.otbm.welcome_to_nordic_tibia_ferries_a2077f4d"] = "Welcome to Nordic Tibia Ferries!",
