  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.razan.L169.1177"] = "Daraman's blessings.",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.red.lilly.L138.363"] = "Hello sweetie. If you need general equipment, stuff like that, let me know.",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.red.lilly.L139.364"] = "Good bye sweetie.",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.red.lilly.L140.365"] = "Of course, just browse through my wares. Remember that if you buy vials of oil, there's a deposit of 5 gold on the empty one.",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.rehon.L67.62"] = "See you my friend.",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.rehon.L68.63"] = "See you my friend.",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.rehon.L69.64"] = "Hello, my friend.",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.richard.L200.340"] = "Hello there, mate. Here for a {trade}? My stock's just been refilled.",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.richard.L201.341"] = "Of course, just browse through my wares. Or do you want to look only at",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.richard.L202.342"] = "Have fun!",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.riddler.L170.645"] = "|PLAYERNAME| HEHEHEHE! Another fool visits the {tower}! Excellent!",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.riddler.L171.646"] = "HEHEHE! I knew you don't have the stomach.",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.riddler.L172.647"] = "COWARD! CHICKEN! HEHEHEHE!",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.robson.L101.1613"] = "Hrmpf, I'd say welcome if I felt like lying.",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.robson.L102.1614"] = "See you next time!",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.robson.L103.1615"] = "No patience at all!",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.rock.in.a.hard.place.L301.138"] = "Everyone on this island has gone crazy! Except for me and you, it seems. Let's {trade} like normal people would.",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.rock.in.a.hard.place.L302.139"] = "Promise to come back sometime, will ya?",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.rock.in.a.hard.place.L303.140"] = "Hey! Don't leave me alone with all these lunatics!",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.rock.with.a.soft.spot.L143.551"] = "Welcome, this is the {Gray Beach temple}, |PLAYERNAME|. Whether you are wounded, poisoned - or wait, don't tell me - yes, this is probably a case of being more emotionally hurt, I will do my best to {heal} you.",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.rock.with.a.soft.spot.L144.552"] = "Only the best for you.",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.rock.with.a.soft.spot.L145.553"] = "Goodbye then, |PLAYERNAME|!",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.rokyn.L75.973"] = "Yes? What may I do for you, |PLAYERNAME|? Bank business, perhaps?",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.rokyn.L76.974"] = "Have a nice day.",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.rokyn.L77.975"] = "Have a nice day.",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.romella.L123.641"] = "I welcome thee, |PLAYERNAME|! I suppose you are looking for a trade in fine weapons!",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.romella.L124.642"] = "Goodbye and please bring more gold next time <chuckles>. I mean, it would be nice to see you again.",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.romir.L154.1041"] = "Greetings, traveller. I'm a magical trader and trainer for sorcerer spells. How may I help you?",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.romir.L155.1042"] = "Good bye.",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.romir.L156.1043"] = "Good bye.",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.romir.L157.1044"] = "Of course, just browse through my wares. Or do you want to look only at",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.roswitha.L69.445"] = "Hello, my lad. Sit down, have a drink, why don't you?",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.rottin.wood.L210.1031"] = "Hunter's greeting! I assume you want something from me since you came all the way out here on your own. This is a dangerous place to be, I doubt that all my men will accept strangers like I do. You don't seem to have any problems with that, though.",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.rowenna.L59.475"] = "Welcome to the finest weaponshop in the land, |PLAYERNAME|! Tell me if you're looking for a good {trade}.",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.rowenna.L60.476"] = "Good bye. Come back soon.",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.rowenna.L61.477"] = "Good bye. Come back soon.",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.rowenna.L62.478"] = "Of course, just browse through my wares.",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.rudolph.L53.206"] = "Oh, a customer. Hello |PLAYERNAME|. If you'd like to see my wonderful self-tailored clothes, ask me for a {trade}.",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.rudolph.L54.207"] = "Oh, good bye.",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.rudolph.L55.208"] = "Oh, good bye.",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.rudolph.L56.209"] = "Of course, just browse through my wares.",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.saideh.L53.693"] = "Hello, my name is Saideh. Once this was the entry to the crypt of our heroes. One of the graves belongs to our beloved hero Dayyan. Nowadays it is not a good idea to visit this place.",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.saideh.L86.694"] = "Well, bye then.",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.sam.L153.910"] = "Welcome to my shop, adventurer |PLAYERNAME|! I {trade} with weapons and armor.",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.sam.L154.911"] = "Good bye and come again, |PLAYERNAME|.",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.sam.L155.912"] = "Good bye and come again.",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.sandomo.L176.5"] = "Hm. Greetings.",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.sandomo.L177.6"] = "Praise the gods, I bid you farewell.",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.sandra.L142.1395"] = "Hello |PLAYERNAME|, welcome to the fluid and potion {shop} of Edron.",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.sandra.L143.1396"] = "Good bye, |PLAYERNAME|, please come back soon.",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.sandra.L144.1397"] = "Good bye, |PLAYERNAME|, please come back soon.",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.sandra.L145.1398"] = "Of course, just browse through my wares. By the way, if you'd like to join our bonus system for depositing flasks and vial, you have to tell me about that {deposit}.",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.sane.mage.L89.1503"] = "...er... hello? Yes...? Well, if... if you have any questions - I am not even here.",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.sane.mage.L90.1504"] = "Yes... then, goodbye.",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.sane.mage.L91.1505"] = "Yes... then, goodbye.",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.santiago.L101.959"] = "Welcome back! Where were we... ? Ah, right, I asked you if you saw your 'level up'! You did, {right}?",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.santiago.L104.960"] = "Welcome back! Where were we... ? Ah, right, I asked you if those nasty cockroaches {hurt} you! Did they?",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.santiago.L107.961"] = "Welcome back! Where were we... ? Ah, right, I asked you if I should demonstrate some damage on you. Let's do it, {okay}?",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.santiago.L110.962"] = "Welcome back! Where were we... ? Ah, right, I was about to show you how you regain health, right?",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.santiago.L113.963"] = "Welcome back! Where were we... ? Ah, right, I gave you a fish to eat?",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.santiago.L116.964"] = "Welcome back! Where were we... ? Ah, right, I asked you if you saw Zirella! Did you?",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.santiago.L119.965"] = "Hello again, |PLAYERNAME|! It's great to see you. If you like, we can chat a little. Just use the highlighted {keywords} again to choose a {topic}.",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.santiago.L250.966"] = "Take care, |PLAYERNAME|!.",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.santiago.L251.967"] = "Good bye traveller, and enjoy your stay on Rookgaard.",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.santiago.L70.954"] = "Hello |PLAYERNAME|, nice to see you on Rookgaard! I saw you walking by and wondered if you could help me. Could you? Please, say {yes}!",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.santiago.L73.955"] = "Oh, |PLAYERNAME|, it's you again! It's probably impolite to disturb a busy adventurer like you, but I really need help. Please, say {yes}!",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.santiago.L80.956"] = "Welcome back, |PLAYERNAME|! Ahh, you found my chest. Let me take a look at you. You put on that coat, {yes}?",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.santiago.L83.957"] = "Hey, I want to give you a weapon for free! You should not refuse that, in fact you should say '{yes}'!",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.santiago.L90.958"] = "Good job! For that, I'll grant you 100 experience points! Oh - what was that? I think you advanced a level, {right}?",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.sarina.L86.73"] = "Oh, please come in, |PLAYERNAME|. What can I do for you? If you need adventure equipment, ask me for a {trade}.",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.sarina.L87.74"] = "Good bye, |PLAYERNAME|.",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.sarina.L88.75"] = "Good bye, |PLAYERNAME|.",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.sarina.L89.76"] = "Of course, just browse through my wares. {Footballs} have to be purchased separately.",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.scrutinon.L101.1548"] = "|PLAYERNAME|. I have been watching your fate for quite some time. It's about time you came here. Do you seek to enter the riven island of Quirefang or travel back from where you came?",
