  ["npc.vanys.multi_6"] = "You empowered all eight ward stones. Well done! You may now enter the Dream Labyrinth via the portal here in the Court. Beneath it you will find the Nightmare Beast's lair. But the labyrinth is protected by seven so called Dream Doors. ...",
  ["npc.vanys.multi_7"] = "You have to find the Seven {Keys} to unlock the Seven Dream Doors down there. Only then you will be able to enter the Nightmare Beast's lair.",
  ["npc.vanys.multi_8"] = "You will have to re-empower several wardstones all over the world, to weaken the beast of nightmares. ...",
  ["npc.vanys.multi_9"] = "The next step would be to enter a place known as dream scar and participate in battles, to gain access to the lower areas. ...",
  ["npc.vanys.say_1"] = "So do you want to learn the {story} behind of this or rather talk about the {task} at hand? ",
  ["npc.vanys.say_10"] = "Very good! You gained the second addon to the dream warrior outfit.",
  ["npc.vanys.say_11"] = "You do not have enough items.",
  ["npc.vanys.say_12"] = "Very good! You gained the first addon to the dream warrior outfit.",
  ["npc.vanys.say_13"] = "You do not have enough items.",
  ["npc.vanys.say_14"] = "Sorry, I didn't understand.",
  ["npc.vanys.say_2"] = "Do you prefer the {long} version or the {short} version?",
  ["npc.vanys.say_3"] = "The Nightmare Beast is slain. You have done well. The Courts of Summer and Winter will be forever grateful. For your efforts I want to reward you with our traditional dream warrior outfit. May it suit you well!",
  ["npc.vanys.say_4"] = "I already gave your task.",
  ["npc.vanys.say_5"] = "They are not literally keys but rather puzzles you have to solve or a secret mechanism you have to discover in order to open the Dream Doors. A parchment in the chest here can tell you more about it.",
  ["npc.vanys.say_6"] = "Are you interested in one or two addons to your dream warrior outfit?",
  ["npc.vanys.say_7"] = "You don't even have the outfit.",
  ["npc.vanys.say_8"] = "I provide two addons. For the first one I need you to bring me five pomegranates. For the second addon you need an ice shield. Do you want one of these addons?",
  ["npc.vanys.say_9"] = "What do you have for me: the {pomegranates} or the {ice shield}?",
  ["npc.vanys.walkaway_msg_1"] = "Well, bye then.",
  ["npc.vascalir.farewell_msg_1"] = "Farewell.",
  ["npc.vascalir.greet_msg_1"] = "Welcome, adventurer |PLAYERNAME|. These are dire times for Rookgaard... have you come to help in our {mission}?",
  ["npc.vascalir.greet_msg_10"] = "Welcome back, |PLAYERNAME|! How about that studded armor - would you like to have it now?",
  ["npc.vascalir.greet_msg_11"] = "|PLAYERNAME|! Thank the gods you are back! While you were gone, something horrible happened. Do you smell the fire?",
  ["npc.vascalir.greet_msg_12"] = "Oh my, what happened to your hair? Your face is all black, too - it must have been a hell of flames down there. That's so brave of you. Did you get the book?",
  ["npc.vascalir.greet_msg_13"] = "Are you prepared for your next mission, |PLAYERNAME|?",
  ["npc.vascalir.greet_msg_14"] = "Now that you know how to store your money, it's time to go after the trolls. I'm even going to give you some more equipment as reward. Do you feel ready for that mission?",
  ["npc.vascalir.greet_msg_15"] = "|PLAYERNAME|, welcome back! That was great work you did there. Let me give you something for your efforts - you deserve it. Here, want a helmet?",
  ["npc.vascalir.greet_msg_16"] = "Greetings, |PLAYERNAME|. Do you have enough space for the brass helmet now?",
  ["npc.vascalir.greet_msg_17"] = "Greetings, |PLAYERNAME|. Are you ready for your next mission?",
  ["npc.vascalir.greet_msg_18"] = "Greetings, |PLAYERNAME|. I see you haven't explored the whole crypt yet - do you need explanations again?",
  ["npc.vascalir.greet_msg_19"] = "Welcome back, |PLAYERNAME|! Did you find a nice, fleshy bone in the crypt?",
  ["npc.vascalir.greet_msg_2"] = "Greetings, |PLAYERNAME|. Your task is still not done - do you remember everything you need to do?",
  ["npc.vascalir.greet_msg_20"] = "Welcome back, |PLAYERNAME|! Do you have enough space for that sword now?",
  ["npc.vascalir.greet_msg_21"] = "Greetings, |PLAYERNAME|! I'm in a really good mood, I must say. We're almost able to infiltrate Kraknaknork's hideout. I have one last little favour to ask and then my plan is complete. Are you ready?",
  ["npc.vascalir.greet_msg_22"] = "Welcome back, |PLAYERNAME|! But - back so soon? Please find the wasps' lair in the north-western region of Rookgaard and use the flask I gave you on its dead body. Or did you lose the flask?",
  ["npc.vascalir.greet_msg_23"] = "Welcome back, |PLAYERNAME|! Were you able to bring back some wasp poison?",
  ["npc.vascalir.greet_msg_27"] = "|PLAYERNAME| - a small word of advice before we continue this mission. You are level 8 now, while it is possible to reach higher levels while still on Rookgaard, you should consider leaving Rookgaard at about level 9. ...",
  ["npc.vascalir.greet_msg_28"] = "You can still go on with this mission, but you won't be able to finish the quest once you've reached level 9. So only kill the monsters you absolutely have to kill - if you want to finish this quest! ...",
  ["npc.vascalir.greet_msg_29"] = "If you don't care about that, you can also simply leave Rookgaard now and learn a vocation by talking to the oracle above the academy. It's up to you. Or - I could simply clean up your questlog, if you prefer. ...",
  ["npc.vascalir.greet_msg_3"] = "Greetings, |PLAYERNAME|. I've heard a loud rumbling from the roof - I hope the stones didn't fall on your toes. Have you loaded at least two catapults?",
  ["npc.vascalir.greet_msg_30"] = "What would you like to do? {Continue} the mission or {delete} the unfinished questline from your questlog?",
  ["npc.vascalir.greet_msg_4"] = "Greetings, |PLAYERNAME|. Actually I have some more equipment I could give to you, but first I want to see how you fight. You have fought before, haven't you?",
  ["npc.vascalir.greet_msg_5"] = "Welcome back, |PLAYERNAME|. Are you done with the 5 rats I asked you to kill?",
  ["npc.vascalir.greet_msg_6"] = "Welcome back, |PLAYERNAME|. Glad to see you made it back in one piece. I hope you're not too exhausted, because I could use your {help} again.",
  ["npc.vascalir.greet_msg_7"] = "Oh, hello |PLAYERNAME|! Have you made up your mind about sneaking into the tarantula's lair and retrieving a sample of her web? Are you up for it?",
  ["npc.vascalir.greet_msg_8"] = "Do you need the instruction for the tarantula's lair again?",
  ["npc.vascalir.greet_msg_9"] = "Oh, well done! Let me take that spider web sample from you - careful, careful... it's sturdy, yet fragile. Thank you! I should be able to make a great paralyse trap with this one. Here, I have something sturdy for you as well - want it?",
  ["npc.vascalir.say_1"] = "Welcome, adventurer |PLAYERNAME|. Thank you for offering your help - but you are already too experienced to start this quest. Just go on hunting monsters, you'll be better off that way.",
  ["npc.vascalir.say_2"] = "|PLAYERNAME|, the only thing left for you to do here is to talk to the oracle above the academy and leave for the Isle of Destiny. Thanks again for your great work and good luck on your journeys!",
  ["npc.vascalir.say_3"] = "Greetings, |PLAYERNAME|. Right now I don't need your help. I heard that Lily south-west of here requires assistance though.",
  ["npc.vascalir.say_4"] = "Greetings, |PLAYERNAME|. Right now I don't need your help. You should pay a visit to Tom the Tanner. His hut is south-west of the academy!",
  ["npc.vascalir.say_5"] = "You can find the vault if you go down the stairs in the northern part of the academy. The book should be in a large blue chest somewhere down there - I hope it's not burnt yet.",
  ["npc.vascalir.say_6"] = "I think it's a good idea to go see Paulie before you leave the village again. Just go downstairs and to the right to find the bank.",
  ["npc.vascalir.say_7"] = "|PLAYERNAME|, you need to discover the troll tunnel and find a way to make it collapse. Maybe you're able to use some of the trolls' tools. Make sure they can't enter the village via that tunnel anymore!",
  ["npc.vascalir.say_8"] = "|PLAYERNAME|, the air smells like victory. Head into the orc fortress and vanquish Kraknaknork once and for all. Don't forget to take the items from below the academy!",
  ["npc.vascalir.say_rats_remaining"] = "You still need to kill {0} more rats. Come back once you've killed enough for some experience and equipment!",
  ["npc.vascalir.stdmod_1"] = "Talk to me if you want to help protecting the village.",
  ["npc.vascalir.stdmod_10"] = "Well, if you change your mind, let me know.",
  ["npc.vascalir.stdmod_11"] = "Here, this studded armor will protect you much better. Fits you perfectly! Now - let's work on your footwear. Tom the Tanner can create great boots out of quality leather. You should pay him a visit!",
  ["npc.vascalir.stdmod_12"] = "Seriously, don't reject that offer. I'm going to give you a studded armor. No one refuses free stuff! If you don't like it, you can sell it - I don't need it anymore. I promise it's not too used or smelly. Want it?",
  ["npc.vascalir.stdmod_13"] = "Then do whatever you have to do first, but please hurry!",
  ["npc.vascalir.stdmod_14"] = "Take a small break then and return to me when you have recovered... and cleaned your face.",
  ["npc.vascalir.stdmod_15"] = "Alright, then just let me know when you're ready. Don't take too much time though.",
  ["npc.vascalir.stdmod_16"] = "This brass helmet will make sure you don't hurt your head. I probably should have given that to you BEFORE you made a rocky tunnel collapse! Take your well-deserved break. Once you're ready for the next mission, talk to me again.",
  ["npc.vascalir.stdmod_17"] = "Seriously, don't reject that offer. I'm going to give you a brass helmet. No one refuses free stuff! If you don't like it, you can sell it - I don't need it anymore. I promise there are no fleas in it. Want it?",
  ["npc.vascalir.stdmod_18"] = "Let me know when you're ready. This should be fun.",
  ["npc.vascalir.stdmod_19"] = "Okay, then good hunting.",
  ["npc.vascalir.stdmod_2"] = "Rookgaard needs your help more than ever.",
  ["npc.vascalir.stdmod_20"] = "Well done, this bone is exactly what I needed! Great. I have to do some preparations, but as reward for your great work, I have a shiny new weapon for you. Here, would you like to have this sword?",
  ["npc.vascalir.stdmod_21"] = "Ah... well, if you lost that bone on the way, that's too bad. I just hope you didn't get hungry and nibbled on it. I wouldn't eat cursed flesh if I were you. Anyway, you can still have this old sword as reward, do you want it?",
  ["npc.vascalir.stdmod_22"] = "This sword has helped me in many fierce battles. I hope you can put it to good use. Once you're ready for the next mission, talk to me again.",
  ["npc.vascalir.stdmod_23"] = "Seriously, don't reject that offer. Just take that sword, it's free. If you don't like it, you can sell it - I don't need it anymore. I promise there are no blood stains on it. Want it?",
  ["npc.vascalir.stdmod_24"] = "Well, then just let me know when you're ready.",
  ["npc.vascalir.stdmod_25"] = "Alright. Here is the empty flask to use on a dead wasp. I also marked the wasps' nest on your map. Be careful and don't forget to wear your silver amulet for poison protection!",
  ["npc.vascalir.stdmod_26"] = "Should I explain it again?",
  ["npc.vascalir.stdmod_27"] = "Oh, but there you have it in your inventory! Yeah, your backpack is a bit of a mess. I understand you overlooked it. Dig deeper!",
  ["npc.vascalir.stdmod_28"] = "No problem. Here's a new one. I can only give you one per hour though, so try not to lose it again this time.",
  ["npc.vascalir.stdmod_29"] = "Great, then please find the wasps' nest, kill one and use the empty flask on its dead body.",
  ["npc.vascalir.stdmod_3"] = "Well, if you change your mind you know where to find me. Remember that if you help Rookgaard, Rookgaard might be able to help you.",
  ["npc.vascalir.stdmod_30"] = "Well, please come back with the poison soon. We won't have much time until Kraknaknork's next attack.",
  ["npc.vascalir.stdmod_31"] = "Oh, but you don't carry any - did you lose the flask? I can give you a new empty one, but that will also reset your mission, meaning you have to extract new poison. Would you like that?",
  ["npc.vascalir.stdmod_32"] = "Alright. Here is the empty flask to use on a dead wasp. Don't lose it this time!",
  ["npc.vascalir.stdmod_33"] = "Great, then please find the wasps' nest, kill one and use the empty flask on its dead body.",
  ["npc.vascalir.stdmod_34"] = "This brass shield is actually brand-new. It's never been used! I hope it will serve you well. Take a small break, regenerate your health, and then talk to me again for your final mission!",
  ["npc.vascalir.stdmod_35"] = "Seriously, don't reject that offer. Just take that shield, it's free. If you don't like it, you can sell it - I don't need it anymore. I promise it's really brand-new. Want it?",
  ["npc.vascalir.stdmod_39"] = "Have you ever heard of Kraknaknork? He's a powerful orc shaman who has recently risen from the orc tribe and started to terrorise Rookgaard. Maybe we can kill several birds with one stone. Listen: ... \\z\n\tWhat would you say about you defeat Kraknaknork, save Rookgaard and earn some experience and better equipment on the way? Sounds good?",
  ["npc.vascalir.stdmod_4"] = "OK, dude!",
  ["npc.vascalir.stdmod_40"] = "Great. We best start by reinforcing our defences. There are four large catapults positioned on roofs high over the village. If you want to fight, you have to build up some muscles. ... \\z\n\tGo into the barn just a few steps to the north-west of here and down the ladder into the cellar. You'll find a huge stone pile down there. Use it to pick up one of the big stones. ... \\z\n\tThey are really heavy, so make sure you have lots of space in your inventory. ... \\z\n\tCarry one stone to at least two of the four catapults located on Norma's roof to the north, this academy and Obi's roof to the south. ... \\z\n\tUse the stone on the catapult to load it. You can load each catapult only once, so try spotting two different catapults. Have you understood all of that?",
  ["npc.vascalir.stdmod_41"] = "Let me explain again then. We best start by reinforcing our defences. There are four large catapults positioned on roofs high over the village. If you want to fight, you have to build up some muscles. ... \\z\n\tGo into the barn just a few steps to the north-west of here and down the ladder into the cellar. You'll find a huge stone pile down there. Use it to pick up one of the big stones. ... \\z\n\tCarry one stone to at least two of the four catapults located on Norma's roof to the north, this academy and Obi's roof to the south. ... \\z\n\tUse the stone on the catapult to load it. You can load each catapult only once, so try spotting two different catapults. Have you understood all of that?",
  ["npc.vascalir.stdmod_42"] = "Well done! The villagers are much safer now that the catapults are ready to fire. You also look like you've built some muscles. ... \\z\n\tGreat - so the piece of equipment I just gave you will not go to waste. Take this studded shield and put it to good use! ... \\z\n\tActually I have some more equipment I could give to you, but first I want to see how you fight. You have fought before, haven't you?",
  ["npc.vascalir.stdmod_43"] = "Ah, that came with confidence. Suited monsters to do some basic fighting would be rats - they actually fight back, but they don't hit that hard. Just make sure you wear your new studded shield and a sword. ... \\z\n\tYou can find rats in the sewers. In case you might think so, this task is not a lame excuse to help us with some rat infestation, we got the rat population quite under control. ... \\z\n\tAlso please don't come carrying their dead bodies - what adventurers somehow tend to do for some reason. Maybe they think they're cats? I'm going to believe you, promise. ... \\z\n\tSo, back to the topic - please kill 5 rats and then come back to me. Shouldn't be too hard, should it? Just pay attention they don't trap you in a narrow passage and take on one at a time. ... \\z\n\tIf you run low on health, go on full defence - click the little shield icon - and leave the dungeon. Nothing corwardish about running, because dying hurts. Are you ready to go?",
  ["npc.vascalir.stdmod_44"] = "Nice. I've marked two rat dungeons on your map. Kill 5 rats and return to me. If you should happen to forget how many you have killed in the meantime, simply check your questlog. ... \\z\n\tI should also give you a small word of warning - once you reach level 8, you should leave this island. Thus you won't be able to continue this quest once you've reached level 9. ... \\z\n\tIt's not good to reach level 9 without having chosen a vocation - you'll be weaker than normal. ... \\z\n\tNo need to be scared, just saying you don't need to plan large hunting sessions while helping me with this mission or kill more rats than I've asked you to. So, good hunting!",
  ["npc.vascalir.stdmod_45"] = "I'll explain it again then. Suited monsters to do some basic fighting would be rats - they actually fight back, but they don't hit that hard. Just make sure you wear your new studded shield and a sword. ... \\z\n\tYou can find rats in the sewers. In case you might think so, this task is not a lame excuse to help us with some rat infestation, we got the rat population quite under control. ... \\z\n\tSo, back to the topic - please kill 5 rats and then come back to me. Shouldn't be too hard, should it? Just pay attention they don't trap you in a narrow passage and take on one at a time. ... \\z\n\tIf you run low on health, go on full defence - click the little shield icon - and leave the dungeon. Nothing corwardish about running, because dying hurts. Are you ready to go?",
  ["npc.vascalir.stdmod_46"] = "Good job. Here's your promised reward - a sabre. You can replace your wooden sword with it, if you still have it - the sabre does more damage. ... \\z\n\tIf you look at a piece of equipment, you can check its stats. By the way, if you use sword weapons such as sabres or swords, you are training your 'sword fighting skill'. ... \\z\n\tThis is quite important if you plan on becoming a melee fighter - the better your sword fighting skill, the higher the damage you do will be. ... \\z\n\tThere are also club and axe type weapons - they train different skills, so maybe you should choose one type of weapon you always want to use. It doesn't make that much difference, but swords often have a good balance between offence and defence. ... \\z\n\tAnyway, I think you're well enough equipped now to leave the village of Rookgaard for another small task. Find Lily south-west of here, she will tell you what she needs done.",
  ["npc.vascalir.stdmod_47"] = "That's the spirit Rookgaard needs. Listen, while you were gone I thought about a way to weaken and fight Kraknaknork - that orc shaman who terrorises Rookgaard. ... \\z\n\tEven if we could make our way into his stronghold past all his minions, we cannot hope to defeat him as long as he is powerful enough to summon demons and access other dimensions. ... \\z\n\tWhile studying the fauna of Rookgaard I came across an interesting specimen that might help us in our battle. Deep in the underground tunnels, there is a spider queen - a tarantula, who is bigger and deadlier than all the other spiders here. ... \\z\n\tHer web is enormous - and causes a strong paralysis. If you could get a small sample of her web, I might be able to craft a trap that we can use to paralyse the orcs so you can get past their defences. ... \\z\n\tDo you dare sneak into the tarantula's lair and retrieve a sample of her web?",
  ["npc.vascalir.stdmod_48"] = "That's very courageous. I'll mark the spider lair on your map. If you leave the village to the north again like before, but walk north-west and cross the bridge, you will find it. ... \\z\n\tListen, I have some more important information regarding your task. It will likely be dark in the cave, so maybe you'll want to buy a torch or two from Al Dee's shop to the left of the barn. ... \\z\n\tThe spider queen is far too strong for you to fight and if she catches you, you might end up in her stomach. The good news is that she is almost blind and relies on her sense of smelling to find her prey. ... \\z\n\tDeep in her lair you'll find some blue greasy stones. If you use them, you'll rub some of the smelly grease on your body. From that moment on you'll be invisible to her, but only for a short time. ... \\z\n\tIf you run into her lair, you should have enough time to retrieve a sample of her web before she catches you. Just USE one of her intact cobwebs in her lair. Good luck!",
  ["npc.vascalir.stdmod_49"] = "Time is of the essence now. The library vault is on fire! It's where Rookgaard's oldest and most important books are stored. ... \\z\n\tThe trolls from the northern ruins somehow found their way into the vault by digging a tunnel from the other side and set everything on fire. ... \\z\n\tYou HAVE to go down there and look for our copy of the book of orc language - while I'm thinking of a reason why I can't go myself. ... \\z\n\tJust kidding, I need to find out just how the trolls got in there before they wreak more havoc. I think there's something bigger behind all this. ... \\z\n\tThe vault is likely set on fire - be careful down there, and don't run into open fire, it can and will hurt you. There should be a rune in the vault that can at least weaken fire, just in case. ... \\z\n\tAre you ready to go?",
  ["npc.vascalir.stdmod_5"] = "Awesome! Off to work with you. I've marked the barn on your map.",
  ["npc.vascalir.stdmod_50"] = "You can find the vault if you go down the stairs in the northern part of the academy. The book should be in a large blue chest somewhere down there - I hope it's not burnt yet. ... \\z\n\tMake sure you're healthy - if you are wounded, ask Cipfried in the temple for a healing first. Good luck!",
  ["npc.vascalir.stdmod_51"] = "What happened, you say? The book was already burnt to ashes? That's too bad... well, you deserve a reward for your courage anyway. Thanks for at least trying. ... \\z\n\tI was trying to figure out a way to get into the orc fortress by maybe using their language... but that won't work now I fear. ... \\z\n\tWe do have to stop the trolls though before taking care of the orcs. I found their tunnel in the northern ruins. Are you prepared for your next mission?",
  ["npc.vascalir.stdmod_52"] = "Great job down there! You do deserve a reward for your courage. Here is a platinum coin for you, worth 100 gold coins. Let me take a look at the book... ... \\z\n\tArgh... the pages are barely readable anymore. I was trying to figure out a way to get into the orc fortress by maybe using their language... but that won't work now I fear. ... \\z\n\tWe do have to stop the trolls though before taking care of the orcs. I found their tunnel in the northern ruins. Are you prepared for your next mission?",
  ["npc.vascalir.stdmod_53"] = "Oh, but you have it! <snags it from you> Great job down there! You do deserve a reward for your courage. Here is a platinum coin for you, worth 100 gold coins. Let me take a look at the book... ... \\z\n\tArgh... the pages are barely readable anymore. I was trying to figure out a way to get into the orc fortress by maybe using their language... but that won't work now I fear. ... \\z\n\tWe do have to stop the trolls though before taking care of the orcs. I found their tunnel in the northern ruins. Are you prepared for your next mission?",
  ["npc.vascalir.stdmod_54"] = "First things first. I think by now you should have gathered some money, and it's better to play things safely instead of rushing into the trolls' lair. You might have seen the Bank of Rookgaard downstairs. ... \\z\n\tEach Tibian inhabitant has a bank account where you can store your money safely - so in case you die, you won't lose it. ... \\z\n\tYou don't have to worry about item loss here on Rookgaard, but as soon as you grow stronger and learn a vocation, it can happen to you that you lose some of your items when dying. ... \\z\n\tIt's probably safer to get used to depositing all of your money on your bank account before you leave for a hunt. ... \\z\n\tGo downstairs and talk to Paulie. I'm sure he can explain to you everything you need to know, and he might also give you a small bonus for your account.",
  ["npc.vascalir.stdmod_55"] = "Very well. What I know is the following: somewhere in the northern ruins, the trolls have found a way to dig a tunnel that leads to the library vault. That's how they were able to set fire to it. ... \\z\n\tYou need to discover that tunnel and find a way to make it collapse. Maybe you're able to use some of the trolls' tools. Make sure that they can't enter the village via that tunnel anymore! ... \\z\n\tAnd please don't hurt yourself in the process. You'll probably have to fight them, so bring food and maybe a potion. If you need to buy something, don't forget that you can withdraw money from your bank account. Good luck!",
  ["npc.vascalir.stdmod_56"] = "Now that we got rid of the troll threat, it's about time we get back to the imminent danger coming from the orc side of Rookgaard. The spider web you retrieved was only the first step - I've thought of something else. ... \\z\n\tTo infiltrate the orc fortress, we're going to make use of a technique I've learnt on the battlefield - distraction! I'll explain the plan to you when everything's ready, but for now I have a small favour to ask. ... \\z\n\tPlease go to the graveyard east of the village, enter the crypt and retrieve a bone. Now I know this is a little morbid, but it would be best if it still had some meat on it. ... \\z\n\tThe graveyard hasn't been used by the villagers for a long time. It's cursed - skeletons are roaming around, so be careful. Take this garlic necklace just in case. ... \\z\n\tUndead monsters tend to drain your life - because their own life force is gone. If you wear it, you'll be protected from it. Search around in the coffins in the crypt, one of them should hold a nice fleshy bone. See you soon!",
  ["npc.vascalir.stdmod_57"] = "Please go to the graveyard east of the village, enter the crypt and retrieve a bone. Now I know this is a little morbid, but it would be best if it still had some meat on it. ... \\z\n\tThe graveyard hasn't been used by the villagers for a long time. It's cursed - skeletons are roaming around, so be careful. ... \\z\n\tUndead monsters tend to drain your life - because their own life force is gone. If you wear the garlic necklace I gave you, you'll be protected from it. Search around in the coffins in the crypt, one of them should hold a nice fleshy bone. See you soon!",
  ["npc.vascalir.stdmod_58"] = "I'm happy to hear that! <whistles> We already have the paralyse trap and the fleshy bone, and now we need one final ingredient to weaken Kraknaknork so that you stand a chance against him. ... \\z\n\tWasp poison! There are many toxic creatures - like snakes or poison spiders - but none is as deadly as the wasp. At least none on Rookgaard. If we could poison Kraknaknork with it, I think he won't be able to make use of his spells for quite a while. ... \\z\n\tThe only problem is - to get it, you need to get close to a wasp, kill it and extract some poison from its dead body. Wasps are located on the north-western side of Rookgaard, which is quite dangerous. ... \\z\n\tHowever, I can give you something for protection - a silver amulet. As long as you wear it, poison can't harm you as much as it usually would do. I'll also give you the flask which you have to use on a fresh, dead wasp. Are you prepared for that mission?",
  ["npc.vascalir.stdmod_59"] = "|PLAYERNAME|, I must say I'm impressed. Not everyone would dare go into that region of Rookgaard and face creatures as strong as wasps. Wait, let me give something to you... ... \\z\n\tHere, with a drop of the wasp poison this potion turned into an effective antidote. Should you get poisoned again and are losing a lot of health, use the antidote potion to cure yourself. ... \\z\n\tThere is also a rune and a spell to remove poison available once you leave this island and arrive on the mainland. It's always good to protect yourself! ... \\z\n\tAnd I have a good shield for you, too. Here, can you carry it?",
  ["npc.vascalir.stdmod_6"] = "Oh, but you have... you should say {yes}!",
  ["npc.vascalir.stdmod_60"] = "The air smells like victory today. I've kept the items you brought from your journeys safe - the time has come to use them. ... \\z\n\tEnter the small treasure room under the academy - just down the stairs and to the right, near Paulie - and open the large blue chest to retrieve them. You'll find a rolling pin, the fleshy bone, the wasp poison and a tarantula trap. ... \\z\n\tNow let me explain the plan in detail. Go to the orc fortress - you've already been nearby when hunting for the wasp poison, it's the same way, but I'll mark it on your map just in case. ... \\z\n\tThere you will have to find a way to sneak past the guards, they are much too strong for you. The rolling pin might come in handy during that part. Afterwards, the fleshy bone will help to create a distraction to get into the fortress. ... \\z\n\tOnce you're inside the fortress, find the orc kitchen and pour the wasp poison into Kraknaknork's soup! The tarantula trap will come in handy if you meet a guard who might seem simply too fast for you. You can use it on him to slow him down. ... \\z\n\t|PLAYERNAME|, take the items and go claim your victory. I know you will do us proud. Good luck!",
  ["npc.vascalir.stdmod_61"] = "You DID kill him indeed! Incredible! This little village can finally live in peace again - and you've grown so strong, too. I'm proud of you, |PLAYERNAME|. My work here is done, and yours too. Thank you for all you've done for us. ... \\z\n\tNow all that is left for you to do here is to talk to the oracle above the academy and travel to the Isle of Destiny. There, you will determine your future - which I'm sure is a bright one. ... \\z\n\tWhat will become of you? A mighty sorcerer? A fierce knight? A skilled paladin? Or a powerful druid? Only you can decide. ... \\z\n\tRookgaard will miss you, but the whole world of Tibia is open to you now. Take care, |PLAYERNAME|. It's good to know you.",
  ["npc.vascalir.stdmod_7"] = "No worries, let's refresh your memory. To fight a monster, click on it in the battle list and you'll automatically attack it. It's as easy as that! If you want to practice, just hunt a few harmless rabbits south of here. Remember it now?",
  ["npc.vascalir.stdmod_8"] = "Actually I think you have killed enough. You should reply with {yes}!",
  ["npc.vascalir.stdmod_9"] = "What do you mean? If you're ready to {help} me again, just say so.",
  ["npc.vascalir.voice_1"] = "Talk to me if you want to help protecting the village.",
  ["npc.vascalir.voice_2"] = "Rookgaard needs your help more than ever.",
  ["npc.vascalir.walkaway_msg_1"] = "Farewell.",
  ["npc.vera.voice_1"] = "Have you moved to a new home? I'm the specialist for equipping it.",
  ["npc.vescu.farewell_msg_1"] = "T-time for another b-beer. <hicks>",
  ["npc.vescu.greet_msg_1"] = "Hey t-there, you look like someone who enjoys a good {booze}.",
  ["npc.vescu.multi_1"] = "You're a true buddy. I promise I will t-try to avoid killing you even if someone asks me to. <hicks> ...",
  ["npc.vescu.multi_2"] = "Listen, I have this old formula from my grandma. <hicks> It says... 30 {bonelord eyes}... 10 {red dragon scales}. ...",
  ["npc.vescu.multi_3"] = "Then 30 {lizard scales}... 20 {fish fins} - ew, this sounds disgusting, I wonder if this is really a potion or rather a cleaning agent. ...",
  ["npc.vescu.multi_4"] = "Add 20 ounces of {vampire dust}, 10 ounces of {demon dust} and mix well with one flask of {warrior's sweat}. <hicks> ...",
  ["npc.vescu.multi_5"] = "Okayyy, this is a lot... we'll take this step by step. <hicks> Will you help me gathering 30 {bonelord eyes}?",
  ["npc.vescu.say_1"] = "Oh, two t-trolls. Hellooo, wittle twolls. <hicks>",
  ["npc.vescu.say_2"] = "I wish there was like a {potion} which makes you sober in an instant. Dwarven rings wear off so fast. <hicks>",
  ["npc.vescu.say_3"] = "It's so hard to know the exact time when to stop drinking. <hicks> C-could you help me to brew such a potion?",
  ["npc.vescu.say_4"] = "Right. <hicks> Since you helped me to b-brew that potion and thus ensured the high quality of my work <hicks>, I'll give you my old assassin costume. It lacks the head part, but it's almost like new. Don't pretend to be me though, 'kay? <hicks>",
  ["npc.vescu.say_5"] = "G-good. Go get them, I'll have a beer in the meantime.",
  ["npc.vescu.say_6"] = "Next time you lie to me I'll k-kill you. <hicks> Don't think I can't aim well just because I'm d-drunk.",
  ["npc.vescu.say_7"] = "Then not <hicks>.",
  ["npc.vescu.say_8"] = "H-hurry up! <hicks> I have to start working soon.",
  ["npc.vescu.stage_1_next"] = "Aw-awsome! <hicks> Squishy! Now, please bring me 10 {red dragon scales}.",
  ["npc.vescu.stage_1_progress"] = "Do bonelord eyes continue blinking when they are seperated from the bonelord? That is a scary thought.",
  ["npc.vescu.stage_1_request"] = "Have you really managed to bring me 30 bonelord eyes? <hicks>",
  ["npc.vescu.stage_2_next"] = "G-good work, ... wha-what's your name again? <hicks> Anyway... come back with 30 {lizard scales}.",
  ["npc.vescu.stage_2_progress"] = "Have you ever wondered if a red dragon means 'stop' whereas a green dragon means 'go'?",
  ["npc.vescu.stage_2_request"] = "D-did you get all of the 10 red dragon scales? <hicks>",
  ["npc.vescu.stage_3_next"] = "This potion will become p-pretty scaly. I'm not sure yet if I want to d-drink that. I think the 20 {fish fins} which come next won't really improve it. <hicks>",
  ["npc.vescu.stage_3_progress"] = "I once had a girlfriend c-called L-lizzie. She had s-scales too.",
  ["npc.vescu.stage_3_request"] = "Ah, are those - <hicks> - the 30 lizard scales?",
  ["npc.vescu.stage_4_next"] = "Alrrrrrrright! Thanks for the f-fish. Get me the 20 ounces of {vampire dust} now. I'll have another b-beer.",
  ["npc.vescu.stage_4_progress"] = "Not normal fish fins of course. We need <hicks> Quara fish fins. If you haven't h-heard about them, ask the - <hicks> - plorer society.",
  ["npc.vescu.stage_4_request"] = "Eww, is that disgusting smell coming from the 20 fish fins? <burps>",
  ["npc.vescu.stage_5_next"] = "Tha-thank you. Trolls are good for something a-after all. Bring me the 10 ounces of {demon dust} now. <hicks>",
  ["npc.vescu.stage_5_progress"] = "Don't you think vampires have something - <hicks> - romantic about them? I think you need a b-blessed steak though to turn them into d-dust.",
  ["npc.vescu.stage_5_request"] = "Have you collected 20 ounces of vampire d-dust? <hicks>",
  ["npc.vescu.stage_6_next"] = "G-great. You're a reeeal k-killer like me, eh? I think I'll g-give you something fun when the potion is complete. But first, b-bring me {warrior's sweat}.",
  ["npc.vescu.stage_6_progress"] = "I like d-demons. They are just as pretty as flamingos. But you need a blessed stake or something to get demon dust. <hicks>",
  ["npc.vescu.stage_6_request"] = "Have you slain enough d-demons to gather 10 ounces of demon dust? <hicks>",
  ["npc.vescu.stage_7_next"] = "Yahaha! Here we g-go. I'll just take a small sip - <gulp>. Okay, this is disgusting, but it seems to work. I'll teach you something fun, remind me to tell you a {secret} sometime.",
  ["npc.vescu.stage_7_progress"] = "If you can't sweat enough yourself, go ask a Djinn. They do - <hicks> magical <hicks> - tractions. Err, extractions.",
  ["npc.vescu.stage_7_request"] = "This s-smells even worse than the fish fins. Is that warrior's sweat?",
  ["npc.vescu.walkaway_msg_1"] = "Oh, two t-trolls. Hellooo, wittle twolls. <hicks>",
  ["npc.virgil.farewell_msg_1"] = "Have a nice day.",
  ["npc.virgil.greet_msg_1"] = "Yes? What may I do for you, |PLAYERNAME|? Bank business, perhaps?",
  ["npc.virgil.voice_1"] = "Don't forget to deposit your money here in the Tibian Bank before you head out for adventure.",
  ["npc.virgil.walkaway_msg_1"] = "Have a nice day.",
  ["npc.vulturenose.say_1"] = "Hey, I rarely see a dashing pirate like you! Get in, matey!",
  ["npc.vulturenose.say_2"] = "YOU WILL NOT PASS! Erm ... I mean you don't look like a true pirate to me. You won't get in.",
  ["npc.walter_jaeger.farewell_msg_1"] = "Keep on hunting!",
  ["npc.walter_jaeger.greet_msg_1"] = "Good hunting! I can offer you some lovely {rewards} for finishing prey hunting tasks! Furthermore I can tell you how many hunting task points (HTP) you actually {have} and you have already {spent}.",
  ["npc.walter_jaeger.say_1"] = "Finishing prey hunting tasks will give you hunting task points (HTP). These can be exchanged for items of the following categories: {outfit}, {mount}, {trophies} and {furniture}. ...",
  ["npc.walter_jaeger.say_10"] = "Sorry, but you don't have enough hunting task points.",
  ["npc.walter_jaeger.say_11"] = "Here you have it.",
  ["npc.walter_jaeger.say_12"] = "Sorry, but you don't have enough slots on your inbox or capacity.",
  ["npc.walter_jaeger.say_13"] = "Sorry, but you don't have enough hunting task points.",
  ["npc.walter_jaeger.say_14"] = "You already have this outfit.",
  ["npc.walter_jaeger.say_15"] = "Here you have it.",
  ["npc.walter_jaeger.say_16"] = "First you need to buy the base addon to unlock this addon.",
  ["npc.walter_jaeger.say_17"] = "You already have this addon.",
  ["npc.walter_jaeger.say_18"] = "Here you have it.",
  ["npc.walter_jaeger.say_19"] = "Sorry, but you don't have enough hunting task points.",
  ["npc.walter_jaeger.say_2"] = "Please note, that all items will be put into your Store inbox!",
  ["npc.walter_jaeger.say_20"] = "First you need to buy the base addon to unlock this addon.",
  ["npc.walter_jaeger.say_21"] = "You already have this addon.",
  ["npc.walter_jaeger.say_22"] = "Here you have it.",
  ["npc.walter_jaeger.say_23"] = "Sorry, but you don't have enough hunting task points.",
  ["npc.walter_jaeger.say_24"] = "You already have this mount.",
  ["npc.walter_jaeger.say_25"] = "Here you have it.",
  ["npc.walter_jaeger.say_3"] = "I offer you the {} mount{}",
  ["npc.walter_jaeger.say_4"] = "I offer you the {}.",
  ["npc.walter_jaeger.say_5"] = "I offer you the {}.",
  ["npc.walter_jaeger.say_6"] = "I have no trophie offer to make.",
  ["npc.walter_jaeger.say_7"] = "I have no furniture offer to make.",
  ["npc.walter_jaeger.say_8"] = "Here you have it.",
  ["npc.walter_jaeger.say_9"] = "Sorry, but you don't have enough slots on your inbox or capacity.",
  ["npc.walter_jaeger.say_offer_mount"] = "The {{{0}}} mount costs {1} HTP.",
  ["npc.walter_jaeger.say_offer_outfit"] = "The {{base}} {0} outfit costs {1} HTP, the {{first}} addon {2} HTP and the {{second}} addon {3} HTP.",
  ["npc.walter_jaeger.store_inbox_full"] = "Please make sure you have free slots in your store inbox.",
  ["npc.walter_jaeger.walkaway_msg_1"] = "Keep on hunting!",
  ["npc.walter_the_guard.greet_msg_1"] = "LONG LIVE THE KING!",
  ["npc.walter_the_guard.say_1"] = "I think there is a pickpocket in town.",
  ["npc.walter_the_guard.say_2"] = "Well, sooner or later we will get hold of that delinquent. That's for sure.",
  ["npc.walter_the_guard.say_3"] = "You can't tell by a person's appearance who is a pickpocket and who isn't. You simply can't close the city gates for everyone.",
  ["npc.walter_the_guard.say_4"] = "If the gods had created the world a paradise, no one had to steal at all.",
  ["npc.warbert.say_1"] = "Take this!",
  ["npc.wentworth.farewell_msg_1"] = "Have a nice day.",
  ["npc.wentworth.greet_msg_1"] = "Yes? What may I do for you, |PLAYERNAME|? Bank business, perhaps?",
  ["npc.wentworth.say_1"] = "Every Adventurer has one. The big advantage is that you can access your money in every branch of the World Bank! ...",
  ["npc.wentworth.say_10"] = "Are you sure you wish to withdraw {} gold from your bank account?",
  ["npc.wentworth.say_11"] = "Are you sure you wish to withdraw {} gold from your bank account?",
  ["npc.wentworth.say_12"] = "Here you are, {} gold. \\z Please let me know if there is something else I can do for you.",
  ["npc.wentworth.say_13"] = "So you would like me to change {} of your gold \\z coins into {} platinum coins?",
  ["npc.wentworth.say_14"] = "So you would like me to change {} of your platinum \\z coins into {} gold coins for you?",
  ["npc.wentworth.say_15"] = "So you would like me to change {} of your platinum coins \\z into {} crystal coins for you?",
  ["npc.wentworth.say_16"] = "So you would like me to change {} of your crystal coins \\z into {} platinum coins for you?",
  ["npc.wentworth.say_17"] = "There is not enough gold on your account.",
  ["npc.wentworth.say_18"] = "There is not enough gold on your account.",
  ["npc.wentworth.say_19"] = "The customer is king! Come back anytime you want to if you wish to {withdraw} your money.",
  ["npc.wentworth.say_2"] = "Would you like to know more about the {basic} functions of your bank account, the {advanced} functions, or are you already bored, perhaps?",
  ["npc.wentworth.say_20"] = "How many platinum coins would you like to get?",
  ["npc.wentworth.say_21"] = "Sorry, you do not have enough gold coins.",
  ["npc.wentworth.say_22"] = "Here you are.",
  ["npc.wentworth.say_23"] = "Sorry, you do not have enough gold coins.",
  ["npc.wentworth.say_24"] = "Well, can I help you with something else?",
  ["npc.wentworth.say_25"] = "Would you like to change your platinum coins into gold or crystal?",
  ["npc.wentworth.say_26"] = "How many platinum coins would you like to change into gold?",
  ["npc.wentworth.say_27"] = "How many crystal coins would you like to get?",
  ["npc.wentworth.say_28"] = "Well, can I help you with something else?",
  ["npc.wentworth.say_29"] = "Sorry, you do not have enough platinum coins.",
  ["npc.wentworth.say_3"] = "Wow, you have reached the magic number of a million gp!!! \\z Your account balance is {} gold!",
  ["npc.wentworth.say_30"] = "Here you are.",
  ["npc.wentworth.say_31"] = "Sorry, you do not have enough platinum coins.",
  ["npc.wentworth.say_32"] = "Well, can I help you with something else?",
  ["npc.wentworth.say_33"] = "Sorry, you do not have enough platinum coins.",
  ["npc.wentworth.say_34"] = "Here you are.",
  ["npc.wentworth.say_35"] = "Sorry, you do not have enough platinum coins.",
  ["npc.wentworth.say_36"] = "Well, can I help you with something else?",
  ["npc.wentworth.say_37"] = "How many crystal coins would you like to change into platinum?",
  ["npc.wentworth.say_38"] = "Sorry, you do not have enough crystal coins.",
  ["npc.wentworth.say_39"] = "Here you are.",
  ["npc.wentworth.say_4"] = "You certainly have made a pretty penny. Your account balance is \\z {} gold.",
  ["npc.wentworth.say_40"] = "Sorry, you do not have enough crystal coins.",
  ["npc.wentworth.say_41"] = "Well, can I help you with something else?",
  ["npc.wentworth.say_5"] = "Your account balance is {} gold.",
  ["npc.wentworth.say_6"] = "Would you really like to deposit {} gold?",
  ["npc.wentworth.say_7"] = "Would you really like to deposit {} gold?",
  ["npc.wentworth.say_8"] = "Would you really like to deposit {} gold?",
  ["npc.wentworth.say_9"] = "Alright, we have added the amount of {} gold to your {balance}. \\z You can {withdraw} your money anytime you want to.",
  ["npc.wentworth.stdmod_1"] = "Waste not, want not!",
  ["npc.wentworth.stdmod_2"] = "Don't burden yourself with too much cash - store it here!",
  ["npc.wentworth.stdmod_3"] = "Don't take the money and run - deposit it and walk instead!",
  ["npc.wentworth.stdmod_4"] = "We can {change} money for you. You can also access your {bank account}.",
  ["npc.wentworth.stdmod_5"] = "There are three different coin types in Tibia: 100 gold coins equal 1 platinum coin, \\z\n\t\t\t100 platinum coins equal 1 crystal coin. \\z\n\t\t\tSo if you'd like to change 100 gold into 1 platinum, simply say '{change gold}' and then '1 platinum'.",
  ["npc.wentworth.stdmod_6"] = "We can {change} money for you. You can also access your {bank account}.",
  ["npc.wentworth.stdmod_7"] = "Your bank account will be used automatically when you want to {rent} a house or place an offer \\z\n\t\t\ton an item on the {market}. Let me know if you want to know about how either one works.",
  ["npc.wentworth.stdmod_8"] = "You can check the {balance} of your bank account, {deposit} money or {withdraw} it. \\z\n\t\t\tYou can also {transfer} money to other characters, provided that they have a vocation.",
  ["npc.wentworth.stdmod_9"] = "You can check the {balance} of your bank account, {deposit} money or {withdraw} it. \\z\n\t\t\tYou can also {transfer} money to other characters, provided that they have a vocation.",
  ["npc.wentworth.voice_1"] = "Waste not, want not!",
  ["npc.wentworth.voice_2"] = "Don't burden yourself with too much cash - store it here!",
  ["npc.wentworth.voice_3"] = "Don't take the money and run - deposit it and walk instead!",
  ["npc.wentworth.walkaway_msg_1"] = "Have a nice day.",
  ["npc.willard.farewell_msg_1"] = "Farewell, |PLAYERNAME|.",
  ["npc.willard.greet_msg_1"] = "Greetings and Banor be with you, |PLAYERNAME|! May I interest you in a {trade} for weapons, ammunition or armor?",
  ["npc.willard.multi_1"] = "Oooh, damn, I completely forgot about that. I was supposed to pick it up from the Outlaw Camp. ...",
  ["npc.willard.multi_2"] = "I can't leave my shop here right now, please go and talk to Snake Eye about that package... I promise he won't make any trouble. ...",
  ["npc.willard.multi_3"] = "Don't tell Rashid! I really don't want him to know that I forgot his order. Okay?",
  ["npc.willard.say_1"] = "Thank you, I appreciate it. Don't forget to mention the package to Snake.",
  ["npc.willard.sendtrade_msg_1"] = "Of course, just browse through my wares. If you're only interested in {distance} equipment, let me know.",
  ["npc.willard.voice_1"] = "Selling weapons, ammunition and armor. Special offers only available here, have a look!",
  ["npc.willard.walkaway_msg_1"] = "Farewell, |PLAYERNAME|.",
  ["npc.willie.farewell_msg_1"] = "Yeah, bye |PLAYERNAME|.",
  ["npc.willie.greet_msg_1"] = "Hiho |PLAYERNAME|. I hope you're here to {trade}.",
  ["npc.willie.sendtrade_msg_1"] = "Ya take a good look.",
  ["npc.willie.stdmod_1"] = "Ah, what the heck.Make sure you know what you want before you bug me.",
  ["npc.willie.stdmod_10"] = "I try out old and new {recipes}. You can sell all {food} to me.",
  ["npc.willie.stdmod_11"] = "I'd love to try a banana pie but I lack the {bananas}. If you get me one, I'll reward you.",
  ["npc.willie.stdmod_12"] = "Which one?",
  ["npc.willie.stdmod_13"] = "This island would be wonderful if there weren't a constant flood of newcomers.",
  ["npc.willie.stdmod_14"] = "If I were you, I'd stay here.",
  ["npc.willie.stdmod_15"] = "I know how to spell.",
  ["npc.willie.stdmod_16"] = "I'm a magician in the kitchen.",
  ["npc.willie.stdmod_17"] = "I'm not in the weapon business, so stop disturbing me.",
  ["npc.willie.stdmod_18"] = "I'm glad that we don't see many officials here.",
  ["npc.willie.stdmod_19"] = "I'm a farmer, not a preacher.",
  ["npc.willie.stdmod_2"] = "Buying and selling food!",
  ["npc.willie.stdmod_20"] = "What about them? Do you live there?",
  ["npc.willie.stdmod_21"] = "I've got no time for your dungeon nonsense.",
  ["npc.willie.stdmod_22"] = "My cousin {Billy} cooks rat stew. Yuck! Can you imagine that?",
  ["npc.willie.stdmod_23"] = "Are you afraid of monsters? I bet even the sight of a {rat} would let your knees tremble. Hahaha.",
  ["npc.willie.stdmod_24"] = "Do I look like a clock?",
  ["npc.willie.stdmod_25"] = "I'm a farmer, not a preacher.",
  ["npc.willie.stdmod_26"] = "Can't stand him.",
  ["npc.willie.stdmod_27"] = "Quite a babe.",
  ["npc.willie.stdmod_28"] = "Don't ever mention his name again! He can't even {cook}!",
  ["npc.willie.stdmod_29"] = "Our little monkey.",
  ["npc.willie.stdmod_3"] = "Make sure you know what you want before you bug me.",
  ["npc.willie.stdmod_30"] = "Uhm, fine guy I think.",
  ["npc.willie.stdmod_31"] = "Boring little girl.",
  ["npc.willie.stdmod_32"] = "Overrated.",
  ["npc.willie.stdmod_33"] = "She thinks she owns this island with her underpriced offers.",
  ["npc.willie.stdmod_34"] = "I don't like hippie girls.",
  ["npc.willie.stdmod_35"] = "Leave me alone with that guy.",
  ["npc.willie.stdmod_36"] = "About time we got a bar here.",
  ["npc.willie.stdmod_37"] = "This old guy has only money on his mind.",
  ["npc.willie.stdmod_38"] = "Hopefully it gets you off this island soon so you can stop bugging me.",
  ["npc.willie.stdmod_39"] = "Uptight and correct in any situation.",
  ["npc.willie.stdmod_4"] = "You, over there! Stop sniffing around my farm! Either trade with me or leave!",
  ["npc.willie.stdmod_40"] = "If he wants to sacrifice all his free time for beginners, fine with me. Then they don't disturb me.",
  ["npc.willie.stdmod_41"] = "This joke of a man thinks he is sooo important.",
  ["npc.willie.stdmod_42"] = "Decent guy.",
  ["npc.willie.stdmod_43"] = "Yeah, so?",
  ["npc.willie.stdmod_44"] = "Overrated.",
  ["npc.willie.stdmod_45"] = "Too old to be interesting for me.",
  ["npc.willie.stdmod_5"] = "Haven't they taught you anything at school? Ask for a {trade} if you want to trade.",
  ["npc.willie.stdmod_6"] = "Help yourself. Or ask the other {citizens}, I don't have time for that.",
  ["npc.willie.stdmod_7"] = "Fine enough.",
  ["npc.willie.stdmod_8"] = "Willie.",
  ["npc.willie.stdmod_9"] = "I'm a farmer and a cook.",
  ["npc.willie.voice_1"] = "Ah, what the heck.Make sure you know what you want before you bug me.",
  ["npc.willie.voice_2"] = "Buying and selling food!",
  ["npc.willie.voice_3"] = "Make sure you know what you want before you bug me.",
  ["npc.willie.voice_4"] = "You, over there! Stop sniffing around my farm! Either trade with me or leave!",
  ["npc.willie.walkaway_msg_1"] = "Yeah go away!",
  ["npc.woblin.greet_msg_1"] = "Hi there human!",
  ["npc.woblin.say_1"] = "Me not give key! Key my precious now! \\z By old goblin law all that one has in his pockets for two days is family heirloom! \\z Me no part with my precious ... hm unless you provide Woblin with some {reward}!",
  ["npc.woblin.say_2"] = "Me good angler but one fish eludes me since many many weeks. I call fish ''Old Nasty''. \\z You might catch him in this cave, in that pond there. Bring me Old Nasty and I'll give you key!",
  ["npc.woblin.say_3"] = "Wonderful. I don't believe you will find Dormovo alive, though. \\z He would not have stayed abroad that long without refilling his inkpot for his research notes. \\z But at least the amulet should be retrieved.",
  ["npc.woblin.say_4"] = "Wonderful. I don't believe you will find Dormovo alive, though. He would not have stayed abroad that long without refilling his inkpot for his research notes. But at least the amulet should be retrieved.",
  ["npc.woblin.stdmod_1"] = "No part of clan. Me prefer company of precious. Or mirror image. Always nice to see pretty me!",
  ["npc.woblin.stdmod_2"] = "What you on quest for? Go leave Woblin alone with {precious}",
  ["npc.woblin.stdmod_3"] = "Me not give {key}! Key my precious now! By old goblin law all that one has in his pockets for two days \\z\n\t\t\tis family heirloom! Me no part with my precious ... hm unless you provide Woblin with some {reward}!",
  ["npc.wyda.greet_msg_1"] = "What? A mundane talking to me? Amusing.",
  ["npc.wyda.multi_1"] = "The blood herb is very rare. This plant would be very useful for me, but I don't know any accessible places to find it.",
  ["npc.wyda.multi_2"] = "To be honest, I'm drowning in blood herbs by now. But if it helps you, well yes.. I guess I could use another blood herb...",
  ["npc.wyda.multi_3"] = "To be honest, I'm drowning in blood herbs by now.",
  ["npc.wyda.multi_4"] = "To be honest, I'm drowning in blood herbs by now.",
  ["npc.wyda.say_1"] = "You brought me a cookie?",
  ["npc.wyda.say_2"] = "Arrr... here we go again.... do you have a #$*§# blood herb for me?",
  ["npc.wyda.say_3"] = "You have no cookie that I'd like.",
  ["npc.wyda.say_4"] = "Well, it's a welcome change from all that gingerbread ... AHHH HOW DARE YOU??? FEEL MY WRATH!",
  ["npc.wyda.say_5"] = "Thank you -SOOO- much! No, I really mean it! Really! Here, let me give you a reward...",
  ["npc.wyda.say_6"] = "Thank you -SOOO- much! No, I really mean it! Really! Ah, you know what, you can have this old thing...",
  ["npc.wyda.say_7"] = "No, you don't have any...",
  ["npc.wyda.say_8"] = "I see.",
  ["npc.wyrdin.farewell_msg_1"] = "Good luck for your travels, |PLAYERNAME|.",
  ["npc.wyrdin.greet_msg_1"] = "Hello, what brings you here?",
  ["npc.wyrdin.multi_1"] = "By Uman! That's one of the rare almanacs of Origus! I had no idea that you are a scholar yourself! And a generous one on top of it! ...",
  ["npc.wyrdin.multi_2"] = "This book must be worth some thousand crystal coins on the free market. Look at the signature here, it's Origus' very own! ...",
  ["npc.wyrdin.multi_3"] = "Of course we should talk again about your request. What do you say makes Farmine important?",
  ["npc.wyrdin.multi_4"] = "There is indeed something that needs our attention. In the far north, a new city named Yalahar was discovered. It seems to be incredibly huge. ...",
  ["npc.wyrdin.multi_5"] = "According to travelers, it's a city of glory and wonders. We need to learn as much as we can about this city and its inhabitants. ...",
  ["npc.wyrdin.multi_6"] = "Gladly the explorer's society already sent a representative there. Still, we need someone to bring us the information he was able to gather until now. ...",
  ["npc.wyrdin.multi_7"] = "Please look for the explorer's society's captain Maximilian in Liberty Bay. Ask him for a passage to Yalahar. There visit Timothy of the explorer's society and get his research notes. ...",
  ["npc.wyrdin.multi_8"] = "It might be a good idea to explore the city a bit on your own before you deliver the notes here, but please make sure you don't lose them.",
  ["npc.wyrdin.say_1"] = "Do you have the papers I asked you for with you?",
  ["npc.wyrdin.say_10"] = "Wrong Word.",
  ["npc.wyrdin.say_2"] = "Oh marvellous, please excuse me. I need to read this text immediately. Here, take this small reward of 500 gold pieces for your efforts.",
  ["npc.wyrdin.say_3"] = "I've heard some odd rumours about this new dwarven outpost. But tell me, what has the Edron academy to do with Farmine?",
  ["npc.wyrdin.say_4"] = "I'm not sure if I'm in the mood to talk about that matter again. Or do you have anything that might change my mind?",
  ["npc.wyrdin.say_5"] = "Hm, you are right, we are at the forefront of knowledge and innovation. Our dwarven friends could learn much from one of our representatives.",
  ["npc.wyrdin.say_6"] = "<sighs> Okay, sending some trader there won't hurt. I hope it will be worth the effort, though.",
  ["npc.wyrdin.say_7"] = "Well, it can't be wrong to be there when new discoveries are made. Also, all those soldiers of fortune that might travel there could turn out to be a good source of income for a magic shop. ...",
  ["npc.wyrdin.say_8"] = "What do you mean the druids of Carlin could provide the service as well? They are incompetent imposters! I will not allow them to ruin our reputation! I'll send some trader with supplies right away!",
  ["npc.wyrdin.say_9"] = "Hm, you are right, we are at the forefront of knowledge and innovation. Our dwarven friends could learn much from one of our representatives.",
  ["npc.wyrdin.voice_1"] = "<mumbles> So where was I again?",
  ["npc.wyrdin.voice_2"] = "<mumbles> Typical - you can never find a hero when you need one!",
  ["npc.wyrdin.voice_3"] = "<mumbles> Could the bonelord language be the invention of some madman?",
  ["npc.wyrdin.voice_4"] = "<mumbles> The curse algorithm of triplex shadowing has to be two times higher than an overcharged nanoquorx on the peripheral...",
  ["npc.xelvar.greet_msg_1"] = "Greetings. Are you interested in adventures?",
  ["npc.xelvar.multi_1"] = "I am glad to hear that. In the spirit of our own foreign legion we suggested the gnomes might hire heroes like you to build some kind of troop. They gave me that strange crystal to allow people passage to their realm. ...",
  ["npc.xelvar.multi_10"] = "They are quite self-sufficient and the fact that they are actually accepting some help is more than alarming. The gnomes are in real trouble and I am kind of an ambassador to find some people willing to {help}.",
  ["npc.xelvar.multi_11"] = "I am glad to hear that. In the spirit of our own foreign legion we suggested the gnomes might hire heroes like you to build some kind of troop. They gave me that strange crystal to allow people passage to their realm. ...",
  ["npc.xelvar.multi_12"] = "I hereby grant you permission to use the basic gnomish teleporters. I also give you four gnomish teleport crystals. One will be used up each time you use the teleporter. ...",
  ["npc.xelvar.multi_13"] = "The teleporter here will transport you to one of the bigger gnomish outposts. ...",
  ["npc.xelvar.multi_14"] = "There you will meet Gnomerik, the recruitment officer of the Gnomes. If you are lost, Gnomette in the teleport chamber might be able to help you with directions. ...",
  ["npc.xelvar.multi_15"] = "Good luck to you and don't embarrass your race down there! Keep in mind that you are a representative of the big people.",
  ["npc.xelvar.multi_16"] = "Good luck to you and don't embarrass your race down there! Keep in mind that you are a representative of the big people.",
  ["npc.xelvar.multi_2"] = "I hereby grant you permission to use the basic gnomish teleporters. I also give you four gnomish teleport crystals. One will be used up each time you use the teleporter. ...",
  ["npc.xelvar.multi_3"] = "The teleporter here will transport you to one of the bigger gnomish outposts. ...",
  ["npc.xelvar.multi_4"] = "There you will meet Gnomerik, the recruitment officer of the Gnomes. If you are lost, Gnomette in the teleport chamber might be able to help you with directions. ...",
  ["npc.xelvar.multi_5"] = "Good luck to you and don't embarrass your race down there! Keep in mind that you are a representative of the big people.",
  ["npc.xelvar.multi_6"] = "Good luck to you and don't embarrass your race down there! Keep in mind that you are a representative of the big people.",
  ["npc.xelvar.multi_7"] = "The gnomes are locked in a war with an enemy that thins out their resources but foremost their manpower. We have suggested that people like you could be just the specialists they are looking for. ...",
  ["npc.xelvar.multi_8"] = "If you are interested to {join} the gnomish cause I can arrange a meeting with their recruiter.",
  ["npc.xelvar.multi_9"] = "They are quite self-sufficient and the fact that they are actually accepting some help is more than alarming. The gnomes are in real trouble and I am kind of an ambassador to find some people willing to {help}.",
  ["npc.xelvar.say_1"] = "Right now I am sort of {recruiting} people.",
  ["npc.xelvar.say_2"] = "You already talked with me.",
  ["npc.xelvar.say_3"] = "Ok, so listen. Your help is needed. That is if you're the hero type. Our ... {partners} need some help in urgent matters.",
  ["npc.xelvar.say_4"] = "I guess the time of secrecy is over now. Well, we have an old alliance with another underground dwelling race, the {gnomes}.",
  ["npc.xodet.farewell_msg_1"] = "Good bye and come again.",
  ["npc.xodet.greet_msg_1"] = "Oh, please come in, |PLAYERNAME| \\z If you need magical equipment such as {runes} or {wands}, just ask me for a {trade}.",
  ["npc.xodet.say_1"] = "So you ask me for a {{}} to begin your adventure?",
  ["npc.xodet.say_2"] = "What? I have already gave you one {{}}!",
  ["npc.xodet.say_3"] = "Of course, just browse through my wares. You can also look at {}.",
  ["npc.xodet.walkaway_msg_1"] = "Good bye and come again.",
  ["npc.xorlosh.farewell_msg_1"] = "See you my friend.",
  ["npc.xorlosh.greet_msg_1"] = "Who are you? Are you a genius in mechanics? You don't look like one.",
  ["npc.xorlosh.multi_1"] = "There should be a book in our library about tunnelling. I don't have that much time to talk to you about that. ...",
  ["npc.xorlosh.multi_2"] = "If you want to have some information, you'll just have to find that book. If you need some equipment, go ask Harog. You'll find the library in the north eastern wing of Beregar city.",
  ["npc.xorlosh.say_1"] = "Hmmmm, you could indeed help me. See this mechanism? Some son of a rotworm put WAY too much stuff on this elevator and now it's broken. I need 3 gear wheels to fix it. You think you could get them for me?",
  ["npc.xorlosh.say_2"] = "HOLY MOTHER OF ALL ROTWORMS! You did it and they are of even better quality than the old ones. You should be the first one to try the elevator, just jump on it. See you my friend.",
  ["npc.xorlosh.say_3"] = "That would be great! Maybe a blacksmith can forge you some. Come back when you got them and ask me about your mission.",
  ["npc.xorlosh.say_4"] = "The book about tunnelling is in the library which is located in the north eastern wing of Beregar city.",
  ["npc.xorlosh.walkaway_msg_1"] = "See you my friend.",
  ["npc.yalahari.multi_1"] = "Hm, no sign of any notes you say? That's odd - odd and a bit suspicious. I doubt you have tried hard enough. ...",
  ["npc.yalahari.multi_10"] = "We need you to enter one of the lesser damaged factories. Go to the factory district and look for a pattern crystal used for weapon production. Use it on the factory controller. ...",
  ["npc.yalahari.multi_11"] = "It will ensure that the factory will provide us with a suitable amount of weapons which we dearly need to reclaim and secure the most dangerous parts of the city. ...",
  ["npc.yalahari.multi_12"] = "I will inform the guards that you are allowed to pass the centre gate to the factory quarter now. Just use the gate mechanism to pass.",
  ["npc.yalahari.multi_13"] = "Recently, our fishermen have been attacked by a maritime race called the quara. They live in the sunken quarter and are a significant threat to our people. I ask you to enter the sunken quarter and slay all their leaders. ...",
  ["npc.yalahari.multi_14"] = "We believe that there are three leaders in this area. Your task is simple enough, so you better don't fail! ...",
  ["npc.yalahari.multi_15"] = "I will inform the guards that you are allowed to pass the centre gate to the sunken quarter now. Just use the gate mechanism to pass.",
  ["npc.yalahari.multi_16"] = "Ah, what an unexpected sight. I can almost feel the energy of the charm. It will help to recover some of the past wealth. ...",
  ["npc.yalahari.multi_17"] = "You did quite an impressive job. I'm considering to introduce you to my ma.. to my direct superior one day. But there are still other missions to fulfil.",
  ["npc.yalahari.multi_18"] = "Destroyed you say? That's impossible! I'm not sure if I can trust you in this matter? One might assume, you fled from the ghosts in terror and left the charm there. ...",
  ["npc.yalahari.multi_19"] = "You will have to work twice as hard on your next missions to restore the trust you have lost.",
  ["npc.yalahari.multi_2"] = "There are only a few chances to impress us. For those who please us great rewards are in store. If you fail though, you might lose more than you can imagine.",
  ["npc.yalahari.multi_20"] = "The old cemetery of the city has been abandoned decades ago when the activity of the various undead there became unbearable. The reason for their appearance was never found out or researched. ...",
  ["npc.yalahari.multi_21"] = "However, those undead could be useful, at least some of them. Particular ghosts consist of a substance that is very similar to the energy source that powered some of our devices. ...",
  ["npc.yalahari.multi_22"] = "Since we lack most of the original sources, some substitute might come in handy. Take this ghost charm and place it on the strange carving in the cemetery. ...",
  ["npc.yalahari.multi_23"] = "Use it to attract ghosts and slay them. Then use the residues of the ghosts on the charm to capture the essence. ...",
  ["npc.yalahari.multi_24"] = "Once it is filled, ghosts will not be attracted any longer. Then return the charm to me. I will inform the guards that you are allowed to pass the centre gate to the cemetery quarter now. Just use the gate mechanism to pass.",
  ["npc.yalahari.multi_25"] = "So have you won us a new ally? Excellent. I knew you would not dare to ruin this mission. Soon we might be able to strengthen our defences and even relocate some of our guards. ...",
  ["npc.yalahari.multi_26"] = "Perhaps some day soon, you lead your own unit of men. However, there are more missions that need to be accomplished. Let's talk about them.",
  ["npc.yalahari.multi_27"] = "This druid dares to affront us? We will look into this when we have enough time. But there are other things that needs to be settled. ...",
  ["npc.yalahari.multi_28"] = "Although, we probably should not do so after your last failure, we are willing to grant you another mission.",
  ["npc.yalahari.multi_29"] = "As you probably noticed, once our city had a park and a zoo around a grand arena. It was a favourite pastime of our citizens to visit this quarter in their spare time. ...",
  ["npc.yalahari.multi_3"] = "For your noble deeds, we would like to invite you to a special celebration ceremony. ...",
  ["npc.yalahari.multi_30"] = "Nowadays, the quarter is lost. The animals are on the loose, and an attempt to revitalise the city with new arena games resulted in a revolt of the foreign gladiators. ...",
  ["npc.yalahari.multi_31"] = "Now all kinds of beasts roam the park, and gladiators challenge them and visitors to test their skills. One of the residents is an ancient druid that rather cares foranimals than for people. ...",
  ["npc.yalahari.multi_32"] = "It is said that he is able to use magic to breed animals with changed abilities and appearances. Such skills are of course quite useful for us. ...",
  ["npc.yalahari.multi_33"] = "We lack the manpower to retake all quarters, or just to defend ourselves adequately. If he bred us some guards and warbeasts, we could strengthen our positionconsiderably. ...",
  ["npc.yalahari.multi_34"] = "Travel to the arena quarter and gain his assistance for us. I will inform the guards that you are allowed to pass the centre gate to the arena quarter now. Just use thegate mechanism to pass.",
  ["npc.yalahari.multi_35"] = "I hope you gave this criminal a real scare! I'm sure he'll remember what he has to expect if he arouses our anger again. ...",
  ["npc.yalahari.multi_36"] = "You have proven yourself as quite valuable with this mission! That was just the first step on your rise through the ranks of our helpers. ...",
  ["npc.yalahari.multi_37"] = "Just ask me for more missions and we will see what you are capable of!",
  ["npc.yalahari.multi_38"] = "So he has been too uncooperative for you? Well, you weren't the first we have sent and you won't be the last. ...",
  ["npc.yalahari.multi_39"] = "However, if you cannot even serve us as a bully, we might have to rethink if you are the right person for us. That was a bad job and we don't tolerate many of them.",
  ["npc.yalahari.multi_4"] = "Only the most prominent Yalahari are allowed to join the festivities. I assume you can imagine what honour it is that you'vebeen invited to join us. Meet us in the inner city's centre. ...",
  ["npc.yalahari.multi_40"] = "We surely cannot allow some underworld kingpin to rule a significant part of the city. Although, I have to admit that his firm grip on the former trade quarter might be useful....",
  ["npc.yalahari.multi_41"] = "I expect you to fight your way through his minions and to show him that we are determined and powerful enough to retake the quarter, if necessary by force. Talk to himafter killing some of his henchmen. ...",
  ["npc.yalahari.multi_42"] = "I'm sure he'll understand that he will succumb to a greater power. That's how his little empire has worked after all. ...",
  ["npc.yalahari.multi_43"] = "Also, I will inform the guards that you are allowed to pass the centre gate to the trade quarter now. Just use the gate mechanism to pass.",
  ["npc.yalahari.multi_44"] = "The former alchemist quarter was struck by even more disasters than the rest of the city. Fires, explosions, poisonous fumes - all sorts of catastrophes. ...",
  ["npc.yalahari.multi_45"] = "The worst plague, however, are unknown diseases that have spread in this quarter and eradicated any human population. We must stop it before other quarters areafflicted. We already identified certain carriers responsible for spreading the plague. ...",
  ["npc.yalahari.multi_46"] = "It will be your task to eliminate them. This spell will protect you from becoming infected yourself. Enter the alchemist quarter and kill the three plague carriers, and atbest anything else you might find there. ...",
  ["npc.yalahari.multi_47"] = "Even more important, retrieve the last research notes that the local alchemists made before the plague killed them. They might be the key for a cure or something else. ...",
  ["npc.yalahari.multi_48"] = "At least we have to make sure that these scientists did not die in vain, and honour their researches. So please bring us these research notes. ...",
  ["npc.yalahari.multi_49"] = "Also, I will inform the guards that you are allowed to pass the centre gate to the alchemist quarter. Just use the gate mechanism to pass.",
  ["npc.yalahari.multi_5"] = "As our most trusted ally, you may pass all doors to reach the festivity hall. There you will receive your reward for the achievements you have gained so far. ...",
  ["npc.yalahari.multi_50"] = "If you please us, a life of luxury as an important person in our city is ensured. If you fail, you will be replaced by someone more capable than you. ...",
  ["npc.yalahari.multi_51"] = "So if you are up for a challenge, ask me for a {mission}.",
  ["npc.yalahari.multi_52"] = "So if you are up for a challenge, ask me for a {mission}.",
  ["npc.yalahari.multi_53"] = "With all the coming and going of strangers here, it would be quite tedious to explain everything again and again. So we have written a manifesto. ...",
  ["npc.yalahari.multi_54"] = "Grab a copy from the room behind me. Let's talk about your further career in our ranks once you've read it.",
  ["npc.yalahari.multi_6"] = "I'm convinced your reward will be beyond your wildest dreams. And that is just the beginning!",
  ["npc.yalahari.multi_7"] = "I'm impressed by your support for our cause. Still, I'm aware that this scheming Palimuth tried to influence you. Think about who are your real friends and who can assist you in your career. ...",
  ["npc.yalahari.multi_8"] = "Come back if you have decided to which side you want to belong.",
  ["npc.yalahari.multi_9"] = "In the past, we had many magical factories providing the citizens with everything they needed. Now that most of these factories are shut down, we have trouble getting enough supplies. ...",
  ["npc.yalahari.say_1"] = "So you have killed the plague carriers. Have you also retrieved the research papers? ",
  ["npc.yalahari.say_2"] = "This will teach these fishmen who is the ruler of that area. You have earned yourself a special privilege. But we will talk about that when we speak about your next mission. ",
  ["npc.yalahari.say_3"] = "Your failure is an outrage! I think we have to talk about the missions you have accomplished so far. ",
  ["npc.yalahari.say_4"] = "Now we will have power we truly deserve!...",
  ["npc.yalahari.say_5"] = "So do you want to side with me |PLAYERNAME|? ",
  ["npc.yalahari.say_6"] = "Great work, take this outfit and you are able to open the door to the reward room.",
  ["npc.yalahari.say_7"] = "Impressive indeed! Someone with your skills will quickly raise in our ranks of helpers. You have great potential, and if you are upfor further missions, just ask for them. ",
  ["npc.yalahari.say_8"] = "I knew that you were smart enough to make the right decision! Your next mission will be a special one! ",
  ["npc.yaman.farewell_msg_1"] = "Farewell, human.",
  ["npc.yaman.multi_1"] = "Hahahaha! ...",
  ["npc.yaman.multi_2"] = "|PLAYERNAME|, that almost sounded like the word of greeting. Humans - cute they are!",
  ["npc.yaman.say_1"] = "Shove off, little one! Humans are not welcome here, |PLAYERNAME|!",
  ["npc.yaman.say_10"] = "Sorry but you don't have the item.",
  ["npc.yaman.say_11"] = "You have no cookie that I'd like.",
  ["npc.yaman.say_12"] = "You see, good deeds like this will ... YOU ... YOU SPAWN OF EVIL! I WILL MAKE SURE THE MASTER LEARNS ABOUT THIS!",
  ["npc.yaman.say_13"] = "Ok then.",
  ["npc.yaman.say_14"] = "I see.",
  ["npc.yaman.say_15"] = "I'm sorry, but you don't have Malor's permission to trade with me.",
  ["npc.yaman.say_2"] = "Be greeted, human |PLAYERNAME|. How can a humble djinn be of service?",
  ["npc.yaman.say_3"] = "Do you want to trade Boots of haste for Enchanted Chicken Wing?",
  ["npc.yaman.say_4"] = "Do you want to trade 4 Warrior Helmet for Warrior Sweat?",
  ["npc.yaman.say_5"] = "Do you want to trade 2 Royal Helmet for Fighting Spirit",
  ["npc.yaman.say_6"] = "Do you want to trade 3 Fire Sword for Magic Sulphur",
  ["npc.yaman.say_7"] = "I trade Enchanted Chicken Wing for Boots of Haste, Warrior Sweat for 4 Warrior Helmets, Fighting Spirit for 2 Royal Helmet Magic Sulphur for 3 Fire Swords",
  ["npc.yaman.say_8"] = "You brought cookies! How nice of you! Can I have one?",
  ["npc.yaman.say_9"] = "Here you are.",
  ["npc.yaman.sendtrade_msg_1"] = "At your service, just browse through my wares.",
  ["npc.yaman.walkaway_msg_1"] = "Farewell, human.",
  ["npc.yana.say_1"] = "{Tokens} are small objects made of metal or other materials. You can use them to buy superior equipment from token traders like me.",
  ["npc.yana.say_10"] = "You don't have enough capacity. You must have {} oz.",
  ["npc.yana.say_11"] = "Your decision. Come back if you have changed your mind.",
  ["npc.yana.say_2"] = "There are several ways to obtain the tokens I'm interested in - killing certain bosses, for example. In exchange for a certain amount of tokens, I can offer you some first-class items.",
  ["npc.yana.say_3"] = "Disrupt the Heart of Destruction, fell the World Devourer to prove your worth and you will be granted the power to imbue 'Powerful Strike', 'Powerful Void' and --'Powerful Vampirism'.",
  ["npc.yana.say_4"] = "If you have any gold tokens with you, let's have a look! These are my offers.",
  ["npc.yana.say_5"] = "I have creature products for the imbuements {strike}, {vampirism} and {void}. Make your choice, please!",
  ["npc.yana.say_6"] = "You have chosen {}. {Basic}, {intricate} or {powerful}?",
  ["npc.yana.say_7"] = "Make sure that you have {} free slot and that you can carry {} oz in addition to that.",
  ["npc.yana.say_8"] = "There it is.",
  ["npc.yana.say_9"] = "I'm sorry but it seems you don't have enough {} ..? yet. Bring me {} of them and we'll make a trade.",
  ["npc.yana.voice_1"] = "Trading tokens! First-class equipment available!",
  ["npc.yana.voice_10"] = "The powerful bundle for the void imbuement consists of 25 rope belts, 25 silencer claws and 5 grimeleech wings. Would you like to buy it for 6 gold tokens??",
  ["npc.yana.voice_2"] = "The basic bundle for the strike imbuement consists of 20 protective charms. Would you like to buy it for 2 gold tokens??",
  ["npc.yana.voice_3"] = "The intricate bundle for the strike imbuement consists of 20 protective charms and 25 sabreteeth. Would you like to buy it for 4 gold tokens??",
  ["npc.yana.voice_4"] = "The powerful bundle for the strike imbuement consists of 20 protective charms, 25 sabreteeth and 5 vexclaw talons. Would you like to buy it for 6 gold tokens??",
  ["npc.yana.voice_5"] = "The basic bundle for the vampirism imbuement consists of 25 vampire teeth. Would you like to buy it for 2 gold tokens??",
  ["npc.yana.voice_6"] = "The intricate bundle for the strike imbuement consists of 20 protective charms and 25 sabreteeth. Would you like to buy it for 4 gold tokens??",
  ["npc.yana.voice_7"] = "The powerful bundle for the vampirism imbuement consists of 25 vampire teeth, 15 bloody pincers and 5 pieces of dead brain. Would you like to it for 6 gold tokens??",
  ["npc.yana.voice_8"] = "The basic bundle for the void imbuement consists of 25 rope belts. Would you like to buy it for 2 gold tokens??",
  ["npc.yana.voice_9"] = "The intricate bundle for the void imbuement consists of 25 rope belts and 25 silencer claws. Would you like to buy it for 4 gold tokens??.",
  ["npc.yasir.farewell_msg_1"] = "Si, jema ze harun. <waves>",
  ["npc.yasir.say_1"] = "Me Yasir.",
  ["npc.yasir.say_2"] = "Tje hari ku ne finjala. {Ariki}?",
  ["npc.yasir.say_3"] = "Soso yana. <shakes his head>",
  ["npc.yberius.farewell_msg_1"] = "May the gods bless you, |PLAYERNAME|!",
  ["npc.yberius.greet_msg_1"] = "Welcome, young |PLAYERNAME|! If you are heavily wounded or poisoned, I can {heal} you for free.",
  ["npc.yberius.keyword_1"] = "So receive the protection of the twist of fate, pilgrim.",
  ["npc.yberius.stdmod_1"] = "So receive the protection of the twist of fate, pilgrim.",
  ["npc.yberius.stdmod_10"] = "No problem.",
  ["npc.yberius.stdmod_11"] = "I think you have forgotten to bring your stake.",
  ["npc.yberius.stdmod_12"] = "Yes, I was informed what to do. Are you prepared to receive my line of the prayer?",
  ["npc.yberius.stdmod_13"] = "So receive my prayer: 'Protection will be granted - from dangers at hand'. Now, bring your stake to Isimov in the dwarven settlement for the next line of the prayer. I will inform him what to do.",
  ["npc.yberius.stdmod_14"] = "I will wait for you.",
  ["npc.yberius.stdmod_15"] = "You should visit Isimov in the dwarven settlement now.",
  ["npc.yberius.stdmod_16"] = "You already received my line of the prayer.",
  ["npc.yberius.stdmod_17"] = "A blessed stake? That is a strange request. Maybe Quentin knows more, he is one of the oldest monks after all.",
  ["npc.yberius.stdmod_18"] = "You are hurt, my child. I will heal your wounds.",
  ["npc.yberius.stdmod_19"] = "You aren't looking that bad. Sorry, I can't help you. But if you are looking for additional protection you should go on the {pilgrimage} of ashes or get the protection of the {twist of fate} here.",
  ["npc.yberius.stdmod_2"] = "Fine. You are free to decline my offer.",
  ["npc.yberius.stdmod_20"] = "Whenever you receive a lethal wound, your vital force is damaged and there is a chance that you lose some of your equipment. With every single of the five {blessings} you have, this damage and chance of loss will be reduced.",
  ["npc.yberius.stdmod_21"] = "There are five blessings available in five sacred places: the {spiritual} shielding, the spark of the {phoenix}, the {embrace} of Tibia, the fire of the {suns} and the wisdom of {solitude}. Additionally, you can receive the {twist of fate} here.",
  ["npc.yberius.stdmod_22"] = "I see you received the spiritual shielding in the whiteflower temple south of Thais.",
  ["npc.yberius.stdmod_23"] = "I can sense that the druids north of Carlin have provided you with the Embrace of Tibia.",
  ["npc.yberius.stdmod_24"] = "I can see you received the blessing of the two suns in the suntower near Ab'Dendriel.",
  ["npc.yberius.stdmod_25"] = "I can sense that the spark of the phoenix already was given to you by the dwarven priests of earth and fire in Kazordoon.",
  ["npc.yberius.stdmod_26"] = "I can sense you already talked to the hermit Eremo on the isle of Cormaya and received this blessing.",
  ["npc.yberius.stdmod_27"] = "You can ask for the blessing of spiritual shielding in the whiteflower temple south of Thais.",
  ["npc.yberius.stdmod_28"] = "The druids north of Carlin will provide you with the embrace of Tibia.",
  ["npc.yberius.stdmod_29"] = "You can ask for the blessing of the two suns in the suntower near Ab'Dendriel.",
  ["npc.yberius.stdmod_3"] = "Keep your adventurer's stone well.",
  ["npc.yberius.stdmod_30"] = "The spark of the phoenix is given by the dwarven priests of earth and fire in Kazordoon.",
  ["npc.yberius.stdmod_32"] = "This is a special blessing I can bestow upon you once you have obtained at least one of the other blessings and which functions a bit differently. ... \\z\n\tIt only works when you're killed by other adventurers, which means that at least half of the damage leading to your death was caused by others, not by monsters or the environment. ... \\z\n\tThe {twist of fate} will not reduce the death penalty like the other blessings, but instead prevent you from losing your other blessings as well as the amulet of loss, should you wear one. It costs the same as the other blessings. ... \\z\n\tWould you like to receive that protection for a sacrifice of |PVPBLESSCOST| gold, child?",
  ["npc.yberius.stdmod_4"] = "Ah, you want to replace your adventurer's stone for free?",
  ["npc.yberius.stdmod_5"] = "Here you are. Take care.",
  ["npc.yberius.stdmod_6"] = "No problem.",
  ["npc.yberius.stdmod_7"] = "Ah, you want to replace your adventurer's stone for 30 gold?",
  ["npc.yberius.stdmod_8"] = "Here you are. Take care.",
  ["npc.yberius.stdmod_9"] = "Sorry, you don't have enough money.",
  ["npc.yberius.walkaway_msg_1"] = "Remember: If you are heavily wounded or poisoned, I can heal you for free.",
  ["npc.yoem.greet_msg_1"] = "Hello |PLAYERNAME|! Do you need some equipment for your house?",
  ["npc.yoem.sendtrade_msg_1"] = "Have a look. Most furniture comes in handy kits. Just use them in your house to assemble the furniture. Do you want to see only a certain {type} of furniture?",
  ["npc.yoem.stdmod_1"] = "Beds, chairs, tables, statues and everything you could imagine for decorating your home!",
  ["npc.yoem.voice_1"] = "Beds, chairs, tables, statues and everything you could imagine for decorating your home!",
  ["npc.yonan.greet_msg_1"] = "How could I help you?",
  ["npc.yonan.greet_msg_2"] = "How could I help you?",
  ["npc.yonan.greet_msg_3"] = "How could I help you?",
  ["npc.yonan.say_1"] = "Could you help me do a ritual?",
  ["npc.yonan.say_2"] = "Here is the list with the missing ingredients to complete the ritual.",
  ["npc.yonan.say_3"] = "Sorry.",
  ["npc.yonan.say_4"] = "Did you bring all the materials I informed you about? ",
  ["npc.yonan.say_5"] = "Thank you this stage of the ritual is complete.",
  ["npc.yonan.say_6"] = "Sorry.",
  ["npc.yonan.say_7"] = "You have all parts of the famous Regalia of Suon! Only a few of them were ever forged, back in the times of the old empire. You are holding a very rare and precious treasure, my friend. ... As you have all four pieces, I could combine them into the full insignia. Shall I do this for you?",
  ["npc.yonan.say_8"] = "Well then, let me have a look.",
  ["npc.yonan.say_9"] = "Sorry, you dont have the necessary items.",
  ["npc.yonan.walkaway_msg_1"] = "Well, bye then.",
  ["npc.zalamon.greet_msg_1"] = "Not many travellerzz zzezze dayzz. I hope you bring good newzz.",
  ["npc.zalamon.multi_1"] = "Fine. I guezz poizzoning zzome of hizz plantzz will be enough to lure him out of hizz conzzealment. Zzizz plant poizzon here should allow you to do zzome zzignificant damage, take it. ... ",
  ["npc.zalamon.multi_10"] = "Your determination izz highly appreciated. To zzneak pazzt zze eyezz of zze enemy, you will have to uzze a diverzzion. Zzere are zzeveral old tunnelzz beneazz zze zzoil of Zzao. ... ",
  ["npc.zalamon.multi_11"] = "One of zzem izz uzzed azz a maintenanzze connection by enemy lizardzz. To enter it, you will have to uzze a dizzguizze. Zzomezzing like a crate perhapzz. ... ",
  ["npc.zalamon.multi_12"] = "Mh, if you can find zzome nailzz - 3 should be enough - and 1 piezze of wood, I should be able to create an appropriate cazzing. Return to me if you found zze itemzz and we will talk about zze next zztep. ",
  ["npc.zalamon.multi_13"] = "You continue to imprezz, zzoftzzkin. ... ",
  ["npc.zalamon.multi_14"] = "A contact of zze rezzizztanzze izz located furzzer in zze norzz of Zao. ... ",
  ["npc.zalamon.multi_15"] = "Zze emperor will drag hizz forzzezz to zze great gate now to bolzzter hizz defenzze. Zzinzze we attacked zze gate directly, he will not expect uzz taking a completely different route to reach zze norzzern territoriezz. ... ",
  ["npc.zalamon.multi_16"] = "I azzume you are already geared up and ready to conquer zze norzz? ",
  ["npc.zalamon.multi_17"] = "You did well on your quezzt zzo far. I hope you will reach zze great gate in time. If we are lucky, it will zztill be open. ...",
  ["npc.zalamon.multi_18"] = "If not, it will already be overrun by enemy zzoldierzz. Direct confrontation will be inevitable in zzat cazze, palezzkin. Now clear your mind and approach zze portal.",
  ["npc.zalamon.multi_19"] = "Zzen zzizz izz zze way which will lead you to zze great gate. ...",
  ["npc.zalamon.multi_2"] = "You can find him eazzt of zze corrupted gardenzz. Zzere uzzed to be a zzmall domizzile zzere but it hazz probably been conzzumed by zze corruption zzo beware. And now - go. ",
  ["npc.zalamon.multi_20"] = "By zze way, before I forget it - zzinzze you are zzkilled in zzolving riddlezz, maybe you can make uzze of zzizz old tome I've found? It containzz ancient knowledge and truly izz a tezztament of our culture, treat it wizz care. ...",
  ["npc.zalamon.multi_21"] = "I may alzzo have anozzer mizzion for you if you are interezzted.",
  ["npc.zalamon.multi_22"] = "Interezzting. It'zz a riddle, zzoftzzkin. Zzuch gamezz are very popular in our culture. I believe zze leverzz will alter zze arrangement. ... ",
  ["npc.zalamon.multi_23"] = "Not too far from zze lever, zzere muzzt be a hint of zzome zzort. An image of how zze zzymbolzz muzzt be arranged. Zzurely zze mechanizzm will trigger a zzecret pazzage, maybe a moving wall or a portal. ... ",
  ["npc.zalamon.multi_24"] = "Zzizz should be our pazz to zze great gate. Head to zze zztorage onzze again. Zzere should be zzome extra greazzy oil which should work wizz zzuch a large mechanizzm. Zze leverzz should zzen be movable again. ",
  ["npc.zalamon.multi_25"] = "Perhapzz you can find a way to enter zze norzz of zze valley and find a pazzage to zze great gate itzzelf. Zzearch any templezz or zzettlementzz you come accrozz for hidden pazzagezz. ... ",
  ["npc.zalamon.multi_26"] = "I wish for a zzafe return wizz good newzz. ",
  ["npc.zalamon.multi_27"] = "Good. Zze fieldzz should be not far from Xiachai in zze eazzt. Go to zze top terrazze and mix zze poizzon wizz zze water. ... ",
  ["npc.zalamon.multi_28"] = "{Poizzon} izz often uzzed by cowardzz, yet it grantzz great power to zze opprezzed. ",
  ["npc.zalamon.multi_29"] = "Not far to zze eazzt of zze village, you'll find rizze fieldzz. Zzey uzze zzem to rezztore zzeir food suppliezz. ... ",
  ["npc.zalamon.multi_3"] = "Alright. Let uzz create a crate. Hm. Let me zzee. ... ",
  ["npc.zalamon.multi_30"] = "In zze zztorage accrozz zzizz room, you'll find a zzpecial poizzon which will zzignificantly weaken zzem if uzzed on zze water and zzoil zze rizze growzz in. ... ",
  ["npc.zalamon.multi_31"] = "Are you fully prepared for zzizz?",
  ["npc.zalamon.multi_32"] = "I'll mark zze entranzze to Chaochai on your map. ... ",
  ["npc.zalamon.multi_33"] = "Conzzentrate on one location at a time. Zze one who chazzezz after two harezz, won't catch even one. ",
  ["npc.zalamon.multi_34"] = "Aaah, zzezze look zzertainly interezzting. Zzezze manuzzcriptzz show uzz zzeveral locationzz of zze enemy troopzz. ... ",
  ["npc.zalamon.multi_35"] = "I'm imprezzed, zzoftzzkin. Maybe you can be of zzome more help. ",
  ["npc.zalamon.multi_36"] = "Zzen indeed, I have a tazzk for you. Lizzten carefully and you might even learn zzomezzing. A wizze being hearzz one zzing and underzztandzz ten. ...",
  ["npc.zalamon.multi_37"] = "Zze mountainzz to zze norzz are overrun by corrupted lizzardzz. ...",
  ["npc.zalamon.multi_38"] = "Beyond zzem, you'll find a lush valley, zze Muggy Plainzz. Find out about zzeir planzz, zzeir tacticzz. Zze lizzardzz' art of war izz characterizzed by dizzguizze and zzecrezzy. ...",
  ["npc.zalamon.multi_39"] = "A traveller told me about a barricaded zzettlement zzey ezztablished. It'zz a weak and in all zzeir arroganzze, poorly guarded outpozzt beyond zze mountainzz. ...",
  ["npc.zalamon.multi_4"] = "Good. Zzat will do. ... ",
  ["npc.zalamon.multi_40"] = "If you can find any documentzz about zzeir zztrategiezz, zze rezzizztanzze will be very grateful. ...",
  ["npc.zalamon.multi_41"] = "Are you interezzted, palezzkin?",
  ["npc.zalamon.multi_42"] = "Mh, zze zzymbolzz of zze chamber you dezzcribe are very common in our culture, palezzkin. You should have come accrozz zzem in many a plazze already. ...",
  ["npc.zalamon.multi_43"] = "Zze zzymbolzz zzeem to be arranged in zzome way you zzay? Were zzere any notizzeable devizzezz? Zzwitchezz or leverzz? ",
  ["npc.zalamon.multi_44"] = "Now we need to get clozzer to zze emperor himzzelf. A hive of beezz would defend zzeir queen wizz zzeir lives in cazze an enemy gained entranzze. Zzizz makezz a formidable defenzze line, nearly inviolable. ... ",
  ["npc.zalamon.multi_45"] = "But a zztranger directly in zze midzzt of zze hive will be acczzepted - after all it izz not pozzible to overcome zzuch a formidable defenzze which izz nearly inviolable, or izz it? Ha. ... ",
  ["npc.zalamon.multi_46"] = "Now zzat you overcame zzeir linezz of defenzze at zze great gate, you only need to find a way to enter zzeir home. ... ",
  ["npc.zalamon.multi_47"] = "Head zztraight to zze entranzze of zze zzity. If you can convinzze zze guardzz to let you enter zze zzity, you should be able to reach our contact zzere wizz eazze. ... ",
  ["npc.zalamon.multi_48"] = "We have alzzo forged zome paperzz for you and zzent zzem to zze zzity. Your victory in zze arena iz well known in our land. Wizz zze help of zzezze paperzz you will pretend zzat zzome of zze higher officialzz want to talk to you about your battle. ... ",
  ["npc.zalamon.multi_49"] = "Zzizz way you will be able to enter zze zzity of zze dragon emperor and meet our contact zzere in zze imperial offizze. He will give you zze next inzztructionzz. ",
  ["npc.zalamon.multi_5"] = "Zze maintenanzze tunnelzz are in zze eazzt of zze plainzz, near ze coazt. Here, I will mark zzem on your map. ... ",
  ["npc.zalamon.multi_50"] = "At zze dawn of time, zze children of zze Great Zznake were numerouzz. Zzey daringly colonizzed many partzz of zze world. But all bravery did not help againzzt zze sheer number of enemiezz zzey encountered. ... ",
  ["npc.zalamon.multi_51"] = "And while zze entitiezz zze unbelieverzz call godzz battled for power out of vanity, zze fazze of zze world changed violently. ... ",
  ["npc.zalamon.multi_52"] = "Many zzentrezz of our magnifizzent zzivilizzation were dezztroyed and only two realmzz zzat we know of remained intact but lozzt contact to each ozzer. ... ",
  ["npc.zalamon.multi_53"] = "In vizzionzz, zze Great Zznake revealed to Zalamon zze exzzizztenzze of ozzer lizzard people in a vazzt jungle in a far away land. ...",
  ["npc.zalamon.multi_54"] = "Zzough zze lizardzz of zze land failed zze Great Zznake and lozzt itzz favour, zzey are zztill in pozzezzion of ancient reliczz of immenzze power, onzze imbued by zze Great Zznake himzzelf. ... ",
  ["npc.zalamon.multi_55"] = "I had vizzionzz of an - item. Yezz. It may be uzzeful for uzz - I mean you, ezzpecially you. ... ",
  ["npc.zalamon.multi_56"] = "We need a zzeptre of power zzat can be found in zze underground of an ancient temple. It hazz been overrun by zzavage apezz and you will have to fight zzem and zze ancient guardianzz of zze temple azz well. Get uzz zzat zzeptre wherever it might be. ... ",
  ["npc.zalamon.multi_57"] = "It wazz revealed zzat it hazz been zzplit into 3 partzz for reazzonzz zzat are of no importanzze anymore. Zzizz powerful devizze could help uzz in our battle againzzt zze emperor. ... ",
  ["npc.zalamon.multi_58"] = "A shaft, a cuzzp, and an emerald form a zzeptre of zzuch power zzat zze partzz were hidden and are now guarded by vile creaturezz. ... ",
  ["npc.zalamon.multi_59"] = "Find it. Retrieve it. And bring it back to me. ",
  ["npc.zalamon.multi_6"] = "Uzze zze dizzguizze wizzely, try to hide in zze dark and avoid being zzeen at all cozzt. ... ",
  ["npc.zalamon.multi_60"] = "You ezztablished zze connection to zze hideout, good. But zzizz izz no time to rezzt. Your new tazzk will be quite different. ... ",
  ["npc.zalamon.multi_61"] = "Zze gardenzz are plagued by a creature. Zze former keeper of zzizz garden became an abomination of madnezz zzat needzz to be zztopped. ... ",
  ["npc.zalamon.multi_62"] = "He hidezz deep underground and it will be dangerouzz to challenge him in hizz lair but I am willing to rizzk it. ... ",
  ["npc.zalamon.multi_63"] = "Find him, dezztroy him, bring me hizz - I uhm, mean it izz utterly nezzezzary for you to deliver me a proof of hizz deazz. ... ",
  ["npc.zalamon.multi_64"] = "Now go - what are you waiting for, zzoftzzkin? Ready to finish what needzz to be finished? ",
  ["npc.zalamon.multi_65"] = "Zze attackzz have weakened our enemy zzignificantly. Yet, your quezzt continuezz. Bezzidezz zzome tazzkzz you could take, zze zzreat of zze emperor izz zztill hanging over our headzz like a rain cloud. ... ",
  ["npc.zalamon.multi_66"] = "Zzo, are you indeed willing to continue zze fight for our cauzze? ",
  ["npc.zalamon.multi_67"] = "Too clozze, far too clozze. I felt a huge impact not long after you left. Zze war machinery of zze emperor muzzt finally have been zztarted. ...",
  ["npc.zalamon.multi_68"] = "I focuzzed and could only hope zzat I would reach you before everyzzing wazz too late. If I hadn't been able to tranzzport you here, our cauzze would have been lozzt. ...",
  ["npc.zalamon.multi_69"] = "I'm afraid we cannot continue zzizz fight here today. Zze rezzizztanzze izz zztill fragile. I'm afraid, zzere izz zztill much left to do. We'll have to prepare for war. ...",
  ["npc.zalamon.multi_7"] = "Onzze you have reached zze norzz, you can find zze rezzizztanzze hideout at zze ozzer zzpot I marked on your map. Now hurry. ",
  ["npc.zalamon.multi_70"] = "You've helped uzz a great deal during zzezze dark hourzz, I've got zzomezzing for you my friend. Pleazze, take zzizz zzerpent crezzt azz a zzign of my deep rezzpect. ...",
  ["npc.zalamon.multi_71"] = "Rezzt for now, you will need it - you have earned it.",
  ["npc.zalamon.multi_72"] = "If I'm correct, zze portal in zze chamber beyond zze mechanizzm will lead you to zze great gate. It izz perfectly pozzible, however, zzat you will not be tranzzported directly into zze area. ...",
  ["npc.zalamon.multi_73"] = "You will razzer be brought to a plazze clozze by your goal. Where exzzactly, I cannot zzay. ...",
  ["npc.zalamon.multi_74"] = "Take all your courage and walk zze pazz zzrough zze portal. At leazzt TRY it - after all, I didn't make you my pupil for nozzing, Kohei. Are you prepared?",
  ["npc.zalamon.multi_75"] = "You have zzolved zze riddle? Imprezzive, palezzkin. Zze humming you hear in zze chamber mozzt zzertainly comezz from a magic portal zzomewhere in zze temple. ...",
  ["npc.zalamon.multi_76"] = "Have you zzearched zze ozzer chamberzz for any magical devizzezz or portalzz?",
  ["npc.zalamon.multi_77"] = "Wizz zze enemy'zz forzzezz weakened like zzizz, we will be able to zzneak pazzt zze defenzze and furzzer inzzpect zze norzz. You should travel to zze mountain range furzzer eazzt of zze village. ... ",
  ["npc.zalamon.multi_78"] = "Zze old route to zze gate hazz been taken by darknezz. You'll have to find ozzer wayzz. Are you up to zzizz, palezzkin? ",
  ["npc.zalamon.multi_79"] = "You accomplished an important tazzk in breaking zze defenzze of zze emperor. Not everyzzing might be lozzt yet. ... ",
  ["npc.zalamon.multi_8"] = "Wizz zzeir eyezz towardzz zze gate, your chanzzezz to zzlip zzrough have never been better. I will keep zze zzpare materialzz here wizz me, we can alwayzz build a new one if you need to. ",
  ["npc.zalamon.multi_80"] = "I've got anozzer mizzion for you which will be even more dangerouzz zzan zze lazzt one. Return to me when you're ready. ",
  ["npc.zalamon.multi_81"] = "Your lazzt excurzzion revealed a terrifying truzz. Zze enemy'zz forzzezz are overwhelming, zzeir zztrengzz probably unrivaled. We cannot attack an army of zzizz zzize unlezz - unlezz we zzin out zzeir rankzz a little. ... ",
  ["npc.zalamon.multi_82"] = "A zzingle individual can be azz zztrong azz an army if he zztrikezz zze army azz a whole. ... ",
  ["npc.zalamon.multi_83"] = "Are you ready for your nexzzt tazzk? ",
  ["npc.zalamon.multi_84"] = "Zzizz izz mozzt unfortunate. Zzo many warriorzz? Large amountzz of food? And how many weaponzz did you zzay? I zzee, hmm. ... ",
  ["npc.zalamon.multi_85"] = "Direct confrontation izz futile. We'll have to find ozzer wayzz to approach zze emperor and hizz army. ",
  ["npc.zalamon.multi_86"] = "Large partzz of zze empire are tainted. I zzee now zzat zzere izz almozzt nozzing left of our onzze zzo zztrong zzivilizzation. But I zztill don't know which danger our enemy really pozzezz. ... ",
  ["npc.zalamon.multi_87"] = "Zzere uzzed to be a remote and quiet zzettlement in zze middle of zze valley. If it hazz not been dezztroyed by zze corruption, I'm zzure zze army of zze emperor will have confizzcated it to gazzer rezzourzzezz. ... ",
  ["npc.zalamon.multi_88"] = "If you can get inzzide zze village, find out anyzzing you can about zzeir zzituation. Zze clever hawk hidezz itzz clawzz. ... ",
  ["npc.zalamon.multi_89"] = "I'm mozzt interezzted in zzeir weaponzz, food and zze zztrengzz of zzeir forzzezz. ... ",
  ["npc.zalamon.multi_9"] = "Wizz zzeir eyezz towardzz zze gate, your chanzzezz to zzlip zzrough have never been better. I will keep zze zzpare materialzz here wizz me, we can alwayzz build a new one if you need to. ",
  ["npc.zalamon.multi_90"] = "Are you prepared for zzizz mizzion? ",
  ["npc.zalamon.multi_91"] = "Zzo you found zze temple... lozzt you zzay. It wazz our lazzt remaining bazztion of hope for help from wizzin zze plainzz. ... ",
  ["npc.zalamon.multi_92"] = "Zzat meanzz zze plainzz are now in zze handzz of zze emperor and hizz army. I'm afraid zzat even zze great gate izz zzealed and zze landzz beyond it tainted azz well. ... ",
  ["npc.zalamon.multi_93"] = "Dark timezz, and I fear we know nozzing about our enemy yet. ",
  ["npc.zalamon.multi_94"] = "Zzurely you have zzeen zze black pondzz and puddlezz all over zze mountain pazz, palezzkin. It izz zze corruption zzat pervadezz zze landzz. It would be wizze not to drink or tazzte from zzem. ... ",
  ["npc.zalamon.multi_95"] = "It zzoakzz zze land, itzz people and even zze air itzzelf. But zzere are zztill zzpotzz not tainted by zze darknezz. ... ",
  ["npc.zalamon.multi_96"] = "A temple, norzzwezzt of zze barricaded outpozzt wizztood zze evil influenzze. However, I lozzt contact to itzz inhabitantzz when zze lizzardzz tightened zzeir grip. ... ",
  ["npc.zalamon.multi_97"] = "No one made it zzrough zze mountainzz for quite zzome time now - exzzept you. Maybe you can find out what happened zzere? ",
  ["npc.zalamon.multi_98"] = "Zzo you are offering your help to a lizzard? Hmm, unuzzual. I don't know if I can fully truzzt you yet. ...",
  ["npc.zalamon.multi_99"] = "You'll have to work to earn my truzzt. Are you zzure you want to offer me your help?",
  ["npc.zalamon.say_1"] = "What newzz do you bring? Did you find any cluezz about zzeir whereaboutzz? ",
  ["npc.zalamon.say_10"] = "Zzizz izz not hizz head but clearly belonged to zze keeper. I - I am imprezzed. You can go now. Leave me alone for a zzecond. ",
  ["npc.zalamon.say_11"] = "Finally. At lazzt. Zze zzeptre izz - ourzz. Ourzz of courzze. A weapon we should uzze wizzely for our cauzze. I need a zzecond or two. Do you leave me already? ",
  ["npc.zalamon.say_2"] = "Ah you have returned. I azzume you already found zzome itemzz to build a proper dizzguizze? ",
  ["npc.zalamon.say_3"] = "Zzo... you finished him. Show me hizz head, will you? ",
  ["npc.zalamon.say_4"] = "You - azzembled zze zzeptre? Hand it out, give it to me, will you? ",
  ["npc.zalamon.say_5"] = "Ah I zzee. You are ready for your mizzion and waiting for me to create and mark zze crate? ",
  ["npc.zalamon.say_6"] = "Zze emperor of zze dragonzz hazz tranzzformed himzzelf into an undead creature to lazzt for all eternity, to cheat deazz. Hizz corruption flowzz to zzozze he bound, and from zzem to zzozze zzey bound, and from zzem into zze land.",
  ["npc.zalamon.say_7"] = "Be warned. Zze mountain pazzezz have been dezzerted for zzeveral weekzz now. No one made it acrozz and I fear you won't meet a zzingle friendly zzoul up zzere.",
  ["npc.zalamon.say_8"] = "Exzztraordinary. We are mozzt fortunate to have zzezze documentzz in our handzz now. Zzizz would zzertainly help me to build an effective rezzizztanzze. Will you give zzem to me? ",
  ["npc.zalamon.say_9"] = "I've marked itzz location on your map. Go and find out what happened zzere. In zze pazzt it wazz known azz zze Temple of Equilibrium. ",
  ["npc.zarak.stdmod_1"] = "In this category I have '{Bruise Bane}', '{Cure Bleeding}', '{Wound Cleansing}', \\z\n\t\t'{Cure Poison}', '{Intense Wound Cleansing}', '{Recovery}' and '{Intense Recovery}'.",
  ["npc.zarak.stdmod_2"] = "In this category I have '{Light}', '{Find Person}', '{Magic Rope}', '{Levitate}', '{Haste}', \\z\n\t\t'{Charge}' and '{Great Light}'.",
  ["npc.zarak.stdmod_3"] = "I can teach you {healing spells}, {attack spells} and {support spells}. \\z\n\t\tWhat kind of spell do you wish to learn? \\z\n\t\t\tYou can also tell me for which level you would like to learn a spell, if you prefer that.",
  ["npc.zarak.stdmod_4"] = "In this category I have '{Whirlwind Throw}', '{Groundshaker}', '{Berserk}' and '{Fierce Berserk}' as well as ... '{Brutal Strike}', '{Front Sweep}', '{Inflict Wound}' and '{Annihilation}'.",
  ["npc.zarifan.greet_msg_1"] = "... ... hello...magic... words?",
  ["npc.zarifan.multi_1"] = "Yes... YES... friendship... lives... FOREVER. ...",
  ["npc.zarifan.multi_2"] = "What you seek.... is buried. Beneath the sand. No graves. ...",
  ["npc.zarifan.multi_3"] = "Between a triangle of big stones you must dig... in the eastern caves. ...",
  ["npc.zarifan.multi_4"] = "And say hello... to... my old friend... Omrabas.",
  ["npc.zarifan.say_1"] = "...Tell me...the first... magic word.",
  ["npc.zarifan.say_2"] = "Yes... YES... friendship... now... second word?",
  ["npc.zarifan.say_3"] = "Yes... YES... friendship... lives... now third word?",
  ["npc.zarifan.say_4"] = "...continue with your mission...",
  ["npc.zarifan.stdmod_1"] = "<sigh> lost... word...",
  ["npc.zarifan.voice_1"] = "<sigh> lost... word...",
  ["npc.zarifan.voice_2"] = "<sigh> ohhhh.... memories...",
  ["npc.zarifan.voice_3"] = "The secrets... too many... sleep...",
  ["npc.zarifan.voice_4"] = "Loneliness...",
  ["npc.zebron.farewell_msg_1"] = "Hey, you can't leave, |PLAYERNAME|. Luck is smiling on you. I can feel it!",
  ["npc.zebron.greet_msg_1"] = "Greetings, high roller. So you care for a game, |PLAYERNAME|?",
  ["npc.zebron.say_1"] = "Ok, here we go ... {}! You have lost. Bad luck. One more game?",
  ["npc.zebron.say_12"] = "Oh come on, don't be a child.",
  ["npc.zebron.say_2"] = "Ok, here we go ... {}! You have lost. Bad luck. One more game?",
  ["npc.zebron.say_3"] = "Ok, here we go ... 6! You have won {}, congratulations. One more game?",
  ["npc.zebron.say_4"] = "Ok, here we go ... 6! You have won a dice, congratulations. One more game?",
  ["npc.zebron.say_5"] = "So you care for a civilized game of dice?",
  ["npc.zebron.say_6"] = "I thought so. Okay, I will roll a dice. If it shows 6, you will get five times your bet. How much do you want to bet?",
  ["npc.zebron.say_7"] = "Hehe, good choice. Okay, the price for this game is 100 gold pieces. I will roll a dice. If I roll a 6, you can have my dice. Agreed?",
  ["npc.zebron.say_8"] = "I am sorry, but I accept only bets between 1 and 99 gold. I don't want to ruin you after all. How much do you want to bet?",
  ["npc.zebron.say_9"] = "I am sorry, but you don't have so much money.",
  ["npc.zebron.voice_1"] = "Hey mate, up for a game of dice?",
  ["npc.zebron.walkaway_msg_1"] = "Hey, you can't leave. Luck is smiling on you. I can feel it!",
  ["npc.zedrulon_the_fallen.farewell_msg_1"] = "May the gods bless you, |PLAYERNAME|!",
  ["npc.zedrulon_the_fallen.greet_msg_1"] = "Welcome, young |PLAYERNAME|! If you are heavily wounded or poisoned, I can {heal} you for free.",
  ["npc.zedrulon_the_fallen.keyword_1"] = "So receive the protection of the twist of fate, pilgrim.",
  ["npc.zedrulon_the_fallen.stdmod_1"] = "So receive the protection of the twist of fate, pilgrim.",
  ["npc.zedrulon_the_fallen.stdmod_10"] = "No problem.",
  ["npc.zedrulon_the_fallen.stdmod_11"] = "You are hurt, my child. I will heal your wounds.",
  ["npc.zedrulon_the_fallen.stdmod_12"] = "You aren't looking that bad. Sorry, I can't help you. But if you are looking for additional protection you should go on the {pilgrimage} of ashes or get the protection of the {twist of fate} here.",
  ["npc.zedrulon_the_fallen.stdmod_13"] = "Whenever you receive a lethal wound, your vital force is damaged and there is a chance that you lose some of your equipment. With every single of the five {blessings} you have, this damage and chance of loss will be reduced.",
  ["npc.zedrulon_the_fallen.stdmod_14"] = "There are five blessings available in five sacred places: the {spiritual} shielding, the spark of the {phoenix}, the {embrace} of Tibia, the fire of the {suns} and the wisdom of {solitude}. Additionally, you can receive the {twist of fate} here.",
  ["npc.zedrulon_the_fallen.stdmod_15"] = "I see you received the spiritual shielding in the whiteflower temple south of Thais.",
  ["npc.zedrulon_the_fallen.stdmod_16"] = "I can sense that the druids north of Carlin have provided you with the Embrace of Tibia.",
  ["npc.zedrulon_the_fallen.stdmod_17"] = "I can see you received the blessing of the two suns in the suntower near Ab'Dendriel.",
  ["npc.zedrulon_the_fallen.stdmod_18"] = "I can sense that the spark of the phoenix already was given to you by the dwarven priests of earth and fire in Kazordoon.",
  ["npc.zedrulon_the_fallen.stdmod_19"] = "I can sense you already talked to the hermit Eremo on the isle of Cormaya and received this blessing.",
  ["npc.zedrulon_the_fallen.stdmod_2"] = "Fine. You are free to decline my offer.",
  ["npc.zedrulon_the_fallen.stdmod_20"] = "You can ask for the blessing of spiritual shielding in the whiteflower temple south of Thais.",
  ["npc.zedrulon_the_fallen.stdmod_21"] = "The druids north of Carlin will provide you with the embrace of Tibia.",
  ["npc.zedrulon_the_fallen.stdmod_22"] = "You can ask for the blessing of the two suns in the suntower near Ab'Dendriel.",
  ["npc.zedrulon_the_fallen.stdmod_23"] = "The spark of the phoenix is given by the dwarven priests of earth and fire in Kazordoon.",
  ["npc.zedrulon_the_fallen.stdmod_25"] = "This is a special blessing I can bestow upon you once you have obtained at least one of the other blessings and which functions a bit differently. ... \\z\n\tIt only works when you're killed by other adventurers, which means that at least half of the damage leading to your death was caused by others, not by monsters or the environment. ... \\z\n\tThe {twist of fate} will not reduce the death penalty like the other blessings, but instead prevent you from losing your other blessings as well as the amulet of loss, should you wear one. It costs the same as the other blessings. ... \\z\n\tWould you like to receive that protection for a sacrifice of |PVPBLESSCOST| gold, child?",
  ["npc.zedrulon_the_fallen.stdmod_3"] = "Keep your adventurer's stone well.",
  ["npc.zedrulon_the_fallen.stdmod_4"] = "Ah, you want to replace your adventurer's stone for free?",
  ["npc.zedrulon_the_fallen.stdmod_5"] = "Here you are. Take care.",
  ["npc.zedrulon_the_fallen.stdmod_6"] = "No problem.",
  ["npc.zedrulon_the_fallen.stdmod_7"] = "Ah, you want to replace your adventurer's stone for 30 gold?",
  ["npc.zedrulon_the_fallen.stdmod_8"] = "Here you are. Take care.",
  ["npc.zedrulon_the_fallen.stdmod_9"] = "Sorry, you don't have enough money.",
  ["npc.zedrulon_the_fallen.walkaway_msg_1"] = "Remember: If you are heavily wounded or poisoned, I can heal you for free.",
  ["npc.zerbrus.farewell_1"] = "Bye, |PLAYERNAME|.",
  ["npc.zerbrus.greet_1"] = "Greetings, |PLAYERNAME|! You're looking really bad. Let me heal your wounds.",
  ["npc.zerbrus.greet_2"] = "<nods> At your service, |PLAYERNAME|, protecting the {village} from {monsters}.",
  ["npc.zerbrus.stdmod_1"] = "Are you injured or poisoned? I can help you.",
  ["npc.zerbrus.stdmod_10"] = "Zerbrus, at your service.",
  ["npc.zerbrus.stdmod_11"] = "I'm the guard of this bridge. I defend Rookgaard against the beasts of the {wilderness} and the {dungeons}, and even of the stinking {sewers}.",
  ["npc.zerbrus.stdmod_12"] = "My duty is eternal. Time is of no importance.",
  ["npc.zerbrus.stdmod_13"] = "Before you fight monsters, deposit your money there. If you die, you won't lose it if it's save in the bank.",
  ["npc.zerbrus.stdmod_14"] = "Fine.",
  ["npc.zerbrus.stdmod_15"] = "I have to stay here, sorry. But I can {heal} you if you are wounded. I have also valuable information about {monsters}.",
  ["npc.zerbrus.stdmod_16"] = "I'm an expert concerning the wildlife and {monsters} on this island.",
  ["npc.zerbrus.stdmod_17"] = "I'm not a gossiper, but if you want to know something about a certain Rookgaardian, ask.",
  ["npc.zerbrus.stdmod_18"] = "They're not that dangerous, but don't let yourself get cornered by many of them. They still can hurt.",
  ["npc.zerbrus.stdmod_19"] = "There are two types of spiders on this island: normal spiders and poison spiders. As their name says, the latter ones can poison you which will cause a constant loss of your health. Beware of them!",
  ["npc.zerbrus.stdmod_2"] = "For Rookgaard! For Tibia!",
  ["npc.zerbrus.stdmod_20"] = "Once you have upgraded your starter {equipment} a little - maybe leather stuff - and got a better weapon as well as a shield, you should be able to kill trolls.",
  ["npc.zerbrus.stdmod_21"] = "You need a stronger weapon than the starter club to kill wolves. Maybe a {sabre} or a short {sword} will do.",
  ["npc.zerbrus.stdmod_22"] = "The orcs have a hideout under the troll cave, just descend deep. Still, be very careful!",
  ["npc.zerbrus.stdmod_23"] = "Minotaurs are very strong. You will need a group of people or at least level 6 and good equipment to be able to kill them.",
  ["npc.zerbrus.stdmod_24"] = "They are a little tougher than they look like, but they're still good beginner monsters.",
  ["npc.zerbrus.stdmod_25"] = "The skeletons on this island are usually fairly hidden. They are often found near graves and always underground. Beware of their evil life drain.",
  ["npc.zerbrus.stdmod_26"] = "There is a bear cave close to this bridge. Be careful, though, they hit hard!",
  ["npc.zerbrus.stdmod_27"] = "Wasp hives exist only behind the north bridge, so ask {Dallheim} for information. I'm glad there are no wasps here. They always make me jump.",
  ["npc.zerbrus.stdmod_28"] = "Snakes can poison you, too, but their poison is usually not as dangerous as that of poison spiders. Just be careful and kill them fast.",
  ["npc.zerbrus.stdmod_29"] = "Premium warriors pay. They gain many advantages this way.",
  ["npc.zerbrus.stdmod_3"] = "No monster shall go past me.",
  ["npc.zerbrus.stdmod_30"] = "HAIL TO THE KING!",
  ["npc.zerbrus.stdmod_31"] = "It's north of the temple.",
  ["npc.zerbrus.stdmod_32"] = "A place of protection. Nothing can harm you there.",
  ["npc.zerbrus.stdmod_33"] = "I can mark you some dungeons on your map if you ask me about {monsters} suited for your level.",
  ["npc.zerbrus.stdmod_34"] = "The sewers are crowded with {rats}. They make fine targets for young heroes.",
  ["npc.zerbrus.stdmod_35"] = "There are {wolves}, {bears}, {snakes}, {deer}, and {spiders} in the wilderness past this bridge.",
  ["npc.zerbrus.stdmod_36"] = "I'm a follower of {Banor}.",
  ["npc.zerbrus.stdmod_37"] = "The heavenly warrior! Read {books} to learn about him.",
  ["npc.zerbrus.stdmod_38"] = "You will learn about magic soon enough.",
  ["npc.zerbrus.stdmod_39"] = "In the world of Tibia, many challenges await the brave adventurer.",
  ["npc.zerbrus.stdmod_4"] = "The premium side of Rookgaard lies beyond.",
  ["npc.zerbrus.stdmod_40"] = "There are many books in the {academy}. Theory can be just as important as practice.",
  ["npc.zerbrus.stdmod_41"] = "It's my duty to protect this village and its {citizens}.",
  ["npc.zerbrus.stdmod_42"] = "It looks like you have mastered the drill.",
  ["npc.zerbrus.stdmod_43"] = "Sorry, I don't trade. Ask the shop owners for a trade instead.",
  ["npc.zerbrus.stdmod_44"] = "I don't approve of her opening a bar. Those drunken adventurers stumbling over the bridge at nighttime are not especially helpful in improving the situation.",
  ["npc.zerbrus.stdmod_45"] = "Such a chicken-hearted person.",
  ["npc.zerbrus.stdmod_46"] = "He sells {weapons}. His shop is south west of town, close to the {temple}.",
  ["npc.zerbrus.stdmod_47"] = "He dedicated his life to welcoming newcomers to this island.",
  ["npc.zerbrus.stdmod_48"] = "She has her own problems.",
  ["npc.zerbrus.stdmod_49"] = "There's something about this guy I don't like.",
  ["npc.zerbrus.stdmod_5"] = "Want to know what monsters are good for you at your level? Just ask me!",
  ["npc.zerbrus.stdmod_50"] = "She's very attractive. Too bad my duty leaves me no time to date her.",
  ["npc.zerbrus.stdmod_51"] = "He guards the temple and can heal you if you are badly injured or poisoned, just like me.",
  ["npc.zerbrus.stdmod_52"] = "She's {Obi's} granddaughter and deals with {armors} and {shields}. Her shop is south west of town, close to the temple.",
  ["npc.zerbrus.stdmod_53"] = "One of these reclusive druids.",
  ["npc.zerbrus.stdmod_54"] = "Her shop is just north of the bridge. She really has good offers.",
  ["npc.zerbrus.stdmod_55"] = "Gentle girl, but a little to esoteric for my taste. However, her {potions} might come in handy.",
  ["npc.zerbrus.stdmod_56"] = "You can find the oracle on the top floor of the {academy}, just above {Seymour}. Go there when you are level 8.",
  ["npc.zerbrus.stdmod_57"] = "The local {bank} clerk.",
  ["npc.zerbrus.stdmod_58"] = "His job of teaching young heroes is important for the survival of all of us.",
  ["npc.zerbrus.stdmod_6"] = "Greetings, |PLAYERNAME|! You're looking really bad. Let me heal your wounds.",
  ["npc.zerbrus.stdmod_7"] = "<nods> At your service, |PLAYERNAME|, protecting the {village} from {monsters}.",
  ["npc.zerbrus.stdmod_8"] = "Bye, |PLAYERNAME|.",
  ["npc.zerbrus.stdmod_9"] = "Hmm, |PLAYERNAME|. I really don't know if you should go into the wilderness without a shield. You should earn some money by hunting rats under the village first until you can afford at least a wooden shield.",
  ["npc.zerbrus.voice_1"] = "Are you injured or poisoned? I can help you.",
  ["npc.zerbrus.voice_2"] = "For Rookgaard! For Tibia!",
  ["npc.zerbrus.voice_3"] = "No monster shall go past me.",
  ["npc.zerbrus.voice_4"] = "The premium side of Rookgaard lies beyond.",
  ["npc.zerbrus.voice_5"] = "Want to know what monsters are good for you at your level? Just ask me!",
  ["npc.zerbrus.walkaway_msg_1"] = "Hm.",
  ["npc.zethra.voice_1"] = "Come over here if you have to resupply!",
  ["npc.zirella.farewell_msg_1"] = "Good bye |PLAYERNAME|, may Uman bless you!.",
  ["npc.zirella.greet_msg_1"] = "Oh, heaven must have sent you! Could you please help me with a {quest}?",
  ["npc.zirella.greet_msg_2"] = "Welcome back, darling... so about that firewood, could you please {help} me?",
  ["npc.zirella.greet_msg_3"] = "Welcome back, darling... so about the {dead trees}, let me explain that a little more, {yes}?",
  ["npc.zirella.greet_msg_4"] = "Welcome back, darling... so about the {branches}, let me explain that a little more, {yes}?",
  ["npc.zirella.greet_msg_5"] = "Welcome back, darling... so about the {pushing}, let me explain that a little more, {yes}?",
  ["npc.zirella.greet_msg_6"] = "Welcome back, darling... so about the {cart}, let me explain that a little more, {yes}?",
  ["npc.zirella.greet_msg_7"] = "Oh, sweetheart, is there a problem with the quest? Should I {explain} it again?",
  ["npc.zirella.greet_msg_8"] = "Right, thank you sweetheart! This will be enough to heat my oven. Oh, and you are probably waiting for your reward, {yes}?",
  ["npc.zirella.greet_msg_9"] = "Oh, welcome back, dear Isleth Eagonst! Are you here for a little chat? Just use the highlighted {keywords} again to choose a {topic}.",
  ["npc.zirella.multi_1"] = "Well, you know that old women like me like to talk a lot. If you see three dots at the end of a sentence, I have still something to say and you should not interrupt, like now ...",
  ["npc.zirella.multi_2"] = "Patience is a virtue, young adventurer! So, the quest was to go into the forest south of here and to find a dead tree. Wait, let me continue! ...",
  ["npc.zirella.multi_3"] = "'Use' a tree to break a dry branch from it. Afterwards, drag and drop the branch back to my cart and select 'Use with', then left-click on my cart. Thanks again for offering your help!",
  ["npc.zirella.multi_4"] = "Thank you darling! My cart is right beside me. It's a little complicated: I need some firewood, but it's very difficult for my slightly advanced age. ...",
  ["npc.zirella.multi_5"] = "Please go into the the forest southeast of here. You will find fine old rotten brown trees. Please RIGHT-CLICK in the lower right corner of that tree and choose 'USE'. That way, a branch should appear on the map. ...",
  ["npc.zirella.multi_6"] = "Don't put it in your inventory like before, but instead DRAG it over the map by LEFT-CLICKING the loose branch, HOLDING the LEFT MOUSE BUTTON and moving it over the map. ...",
  ["npc.zirella.multi_7"] = "When you are close to my cart, USE the branch WITH the cart: RIGHT-CLICK the branch on the floor and select 'USE WITH', Then LEFT-CLICK on the cart. Don't worry, you will see what I mean on the way. Thanks and {bye} for now!",
  ["npc.zirella.say_1"] = "By the way, 'quest' is a keyword that many NPCs react to, especially those which have tasks for you. So darling, about that {quest}... are you listening?",
  ["npc.zirella.say_2"] = "Thank you so much for your kindness. I'm an old woman and I desperately need firewood for my oven. Could you please help me?",
  ["npc.zirella.say_3"] = "You're such a treasure. In the forest south of here, there are {dead trees} without any leaves. The first thing you have to do is search for one, {okay}?",
  ["npc.zirella.say_4"] = "Splendid, once you've found one, 'Use' it to break a branch from it. Did you understand that so far?",
  ["npc.zirella.say_5"] = "Good... so after you broke a branch, please push it here and select 'use with'. That will turn your mouse cursor into crosshairs. Then left-click on my cart. {Alright}?",
  ["npc.zirella.say_6"] = "To push the branch, drag and drop it on the grass by holding the left mousebutton and moving the cursor to where you want to throw the branch. Just push it near my cart before you 'Use' it, {alright}?",
  ["npc.zirella.say_7"] = "Oh, you deserve it. You really have earned some experience! Also, you may enter my little house now and take what's in that chest beside my bed. Good {bye} for now!",
  ["npc.zirella.say_8"] = "Well then, I hope you find nice and dry branches for me! Good {bye}!",
  ["npc.zirella.voice_1"] = "I wish someone could spare a minute and help me...",
  ["npc.zirella.voice_2"] = "This is too hard for an old woman like me.",
  ["npc.zirella.voice_3"] = "Hello, young adventurer, you look strong enough to help me!",
  ["npc.zirella.walkaway_msg_1"] = "Good bye traveller, take care.",
  ["npc.ziyad.farewell_msg_1"] = "Good bye. Recommend us if you were satisfied with our service.",
  ["npc.ziyad.greet_msg_1"] = "Ah, the wind brings in another visitor. Welcome, dear guest. Are you looking for a {passage} with my carpet?",
  ["npc.ziyad.stdmod_1"] = "Feel the wind in your hair during one of my carpet rides!",
  ["npc.ziyad.stdmod_10"] = "I can fly you to {Darashia}, to {Svargrond}, to {Kazordoon}, to {Zao}, to the {Femor Hills}, to {Edron} or to {Issavi} if you like. Where do you want to go?",
  ["npc.ziyad.stdmod_11"] = "I can fly you to {Darashia}, to {Svargrond}, to {Kazordoon}, to {Zao}, to the {Femor Hills}, to {Edron} or to {Issavi} if you like. Where do you want to go?",
  ["npc.ziyad.stdmod_3"] = "Do you seek a passage to {0} for {1}?",
  ["npc.ziyad.stdmod_4"] = "We would like to serve you some time.",
  ["npc.ziyad.stdmod_5"] = "I can fly you to {Darashia}, to {Svargrond}, to {Kazordoon}, to {Zao}, to the {Femor Hills}, to {Edron} or to {Issavi} if you like. Where do you want to go?",
  ["npc.ziyad.stdmod_6"] = "I can fly you to {Darashia}, to {Svargrond}, to {Kazordoon}, to {Zao}, to the {Femor Hills}, to {Edron} or to {Issavi} if you like. Where do you want to go?",
  ["npc.ziyad.stdmod_7"] = "I can fly you to {Darashia}, to {Svargrond}, to {Kazordoon}, to {Zao}, to the {Femor Hills}, to {Edron} or to {Issavi} if you like. Where do you want to go?",
  ["npc.ziyad.stdmod_8"] = "I can fly you to {Darashia}, {Edron}, {Issavi}, {Svargrond}, {Kazordoon}, {Zao} or to {Femor Hills} if you like. Where do you want to go?",
  ["npc.ziyad.stdmod_9"] = "I can fly you to {Darashia}, to {Svargrond}, to {Kazordoon}, to {Zao}, to the {Femor Hills}, to {Edron} or to {Issavi} if you like. Where do you want to go?",
  ["npc.ziyad.voice_1"] = "Feel the wind in your hair during one of my carpet rides!",
  ["npc.ziyad.walkaway_msg_1"] = "Good bye then.",
  ["npc.zizzle.greet_msg_1"] = "Ah our human {alliez} have finally arrived! I've already feared zat ze emperor'z forzez had caught you. Your rezilienze and prowezz are imprezzive.",
  ["npc.zizzle.multi_1"] = "Didn't exzpect anyzing lezz from you. Alright, zankz to your effortz to build an effective reziztanze, our comradez zalvaged ziz potion and ze formula you need to utter to breach hiz zubconzciouznezz. ...",
  ["npc.zizzle.multi_10"] = "I recommend not to go alone becauze it will be very dangerouz - but ALL of you will have to uze zeir zeptre replicaz on ze emperor'z remainz to prozeed! ...",
  ["npc.zizzle.multi_11"] = "You will need it. Now go to the north of Sleeping Dragon room, {dont need talk} with he! Good luck.",
  ["npc.zizzle.multi_12"] = "Ze dragon emperor controlz ze whole empire wiz hiz willpower. But even he iz not powerful enough to uze ziz control continuouzly wizout zome form of aid. ... ",
  ["npc.zizzle.multi_13"] = "Wiz ze ancient zeptre zat you acquired for uz earlier, I can charge ozer zeptrez wiz azpectz of power of ze Great Znake. If you manage to touch one of ze tranzmitter cryztalz wiz ze zeptre, itz godly power will realign ze cryztal. ...",
  ["npc.zizzle.multi_14"] = "Not only will ze cryztal ztop zending ze orderz of ze emperor into ze mindz of my opprezzed people, it will alzo zend a mezzage of freedom and zelf-rezpect inztead. ...",
  ["npc.zizzle.multi_15"] = "Dizabling ze cryztalz will probably alert ze emperor. It will likely be too late for him to intervene in perzon but a creature of hiz power might have ozer wayz to intervene. ...",
  ["npc.zizzle.multi_16"] = "But zere iz more. To reach ze emperor, you will need accezz to hiz inner realmz. Ze zecret to enter iz guarded by a dragon. ...",
  ["npc.zizzle.multi_17"] = "But ziz iz not ze catch - ze catch iz, zat ze key iz buried in hiz vazt mind. Ze emperor haz bound ze dragon to himzelf, forzing him into an eternal zlumber. ...",
  ["npc.zizzle.multi_18"] = "A zignificant part of ze emperor'z power iz uzed to reztrain ze dragon. Ze only way to free him will be to enter hiz dreamz. Are you prepared for ziz?",
  ["npc.zizzle.multi_2"] = "Drink it and when you are cloze to ze dragon zpeak: Z...z.. well, juzt take ze sheet wiz ze word and read it yourzelf. A lot of rebelz have died to retrieve ziz information, uze it wizely. ...",
  ["npc.zizzle.multi_3"] = "Now go and try to find a way to reach ze emperor and to free ze land from it'z opprezzor. Onze you have found a way, return to me and I will explain what to do wiz ze cryztalz. May ze Great Znake guide you!",
  ["npc.zizzle.multi_4"] = "You freed ze dragon! And you pozzezz ze key to enter ze inner realmz of ze emperor, well done. ...",
  ["npc.zizzle.multi_5"] = "Now you are ready to reach ze inner zanctum of ze emperor. Zalamon'z revelationz showed him zat zere are four cryztalz channelling ze will of ze emperor into ze land. ...",
  ["npc.zizzle.multi_6"] = "Wiz ze relic you gained from Zalamon we were able to create powerful replicaz of ze zeptre. Take ziz wiz you. ...",
  ["npc.zizzle.multi_7"] = "You will have to realign ze cryztalz one after ze ozer. Ztart wiz ze one in ze norz-wezt and work your way clockwize zrough ze room. ...",
  ["npc.zizzle.multi_8"] = "Uzing ze zeptre will forze a part of ze emperor'z willpower out of ze cryztal. You will have to kill zoze manifeztationz. ...",
  ["npc.zizzle.multi_9"] = "Zen uze your zeptre on ze remainz to deztroy ze emperor'z influenze over ze cryztal. ...",
  ["npc.zizzle.say_1"] = "You made it! Az zoon az you are prepared, I will brief you for your nexzt mizzion. ",
  ["npc.zizzle.say_2"] = "Now go to the north of Sleeping Dragon room, {dont need talk} with he!",
  ["npc.zlak.farewell_msg_1"] = "Juzt leave me alone.",
  ["npc.zlak.greet_msg_1"] = "Ah, ze human everyone iz talking about. Your victory over ze champion waz quite imprezzive. ...",
  ["npc.zlak.greet_msg_2"] = "Alzough, for many ziz only provez what a huge zreat you blank-zkinz ztill poze. What do you {want}?",
  ["npc.zlak.multi_1"] = "Your eagernezz for killing and bloodshed iz frightening, but your next mizzion will zuit your tazte. Wiz ze zity in chaoz and defenzez diverted, ze ztage iz zet for our final ztrike. ...",
  ["npc.zlak.multi_10"] = "Ze rumour mill iz quite fazt. Ezpecially when zomeone unuzual az you enterz ze zity. Zoon zey will learn zat you have no reazon to be here and our raze will be buzted. ...",
  ["npc.zlak.multi_11"] = "Zo we have to ztrike fazt and quickly. You will have to eliminate zome high ranking key officialz. I zink killing four of zem should be enough. ...",
  ["npc.zlak.multi_12"] = "Ziz will dizrupt ze order in ze zity zignificantly zinze zo much dependz on bureaucracy and ze chain of command. Only chaoz and dizorganization will enable me to help you with ze next ztep in ze plan.",
  ["npc.zlak.multi_2"] = "A large number of rebelz have arrived undercover in ze zity. Zey will attack ze palaze and zome loyal palaze guardz will let zem in. ...",
  ["npc.zlak.multi_3"] = "Meanwhile, you will take ze old ezcape tunnel zat leadz from ze abandoned bazement in ze norz of ze miniztry to a lift zat endz zomewhere in ze palaze. ...",
  ["npc.zlak.multi_4"] = "When everyzing workz according to ze plan, you will meet Zalamon zomewhere in the underground part of ze palaze.",
  ["npc.zlak.multi_5"] = "Word of your deedz iz already zpreading like a wildfire. Zalamon'z plan to unleash zome murderouz beaztz in ze zity workz almozt too well. You are already becoming zome kind of legend with which motherz frighten zeir unruly hatchlingz. ...",
  ["npc.zlak.multi_6"] = "Your next {mizzion} will be a ztrike into ze heart of ze empire.",
  ["npc.zlak.multi_7"] = "Chaoz and panic are already zpreading. Your barbaric brutality iz frightening effectively. I could acquire a key zat we need to get you into ze palaze itzelf. But zere are ztill too many guardz and elite zquadz even for you to fight. ...",
  ["npc.zlak.multi_8"] = "I need you to enter ze zity and zlay at leazt zix noblez. Ze otherz will feel zreatened and call guardz to zemzelvez, and ze dragon kingz will accuze each ozer to be rezponzible for zlaying zeir pet noblez. ...",
  ["npc.zlak.multi_9"] = "Zat should enable uz to give you at leazt a chanze to attack ze palaze.",
  ["npc.znozel.farewell_msg_1"] = "Have a nice day.",
  ["npc.znozel.greet_msg_1"] = "Yes? What may I do for you, |PLAYERNAME|? Bank business, perhaps?",
  ["npc.znozel.voice_1"] = "Don't forget to deposit your money here in the Global Bank before you head out for adventure.",
  ["npc.znozel.walkaway_msg_1"] = "Have a nice day.",
  ["npc.zoltan.farewell_msg_1"] = "Use your knowledge wisely, |PLAYERNAME|.",
  ["npc.zoltan.greet_msg_1"] = "Welcome |PLAYERNAME|, student of the arcane arts. I teach the fiercest {spells} available.",
  ["npc.zoltan.say_1"] = "Bah, I know. I received some sort of 'nomination' from our outpost in Port Hope. ...",
  ["npc.zoltan.say_2"] = "Usually it takes a little more than that for an award though. However, I honour Myra's word. ...",
  ["npc.zoltan.say_3"] = "I hereby grant you the right to wear a special sign of honour, acknowledged by the academy of Edron. Since you are a woman, I guess you don't want manly stuff. There you go.",
  ["npc.zoltan.say_4"] = "I bow to you, player, and hereby grant you the right to wear Ferumbras' hat as accessory. Congratulations!",
  ["npc.zoltan.say_5"] = "Sorry you don't have the Ferumbras' hat.",
  ["npc.zoltan.say_6"] = "This task is only available for male players who don't already have the addon.",
  ["npc.zoltan.say_7"] = "Stop bothering me. I am a far too busy man to be constantly giving out awards.",
  ["npc.zoltan.say_8"] = "What the hell are you talking about?",
  ["npc.zora.farewell_msg_1"] = "Good bye, |PLAYERNAME|.",
  ["npc.zora.greet_msg_1"] = "Oh, please come in, |PLAYERNAME|. What can I do for you? If you need adventure equipment, ask me for a {trade}.",
  ["npc.zora.say_1"] = "Do you want to buy a football for 111 gold?",
  ["npc.zora.say_2"] = "Here it is.",
  ["npc.zora.say_3"] = "You don't have enough money.",
  ["npc.zora.sendtrade_msg_1"] = "Of course, just browse through my wares. {Footballs} have to be purchased separately.",
  ["npc.zora.stdmod_1"] = "I sell equipment for your adventure! Just ask me for a {trade} to see my wares.",
  ["npc.zora.walkaway_msg_1"] = "Good bye, |PLAYERNAME|.",
  ["npc.ztiss.greet_msg_1"] = "Be greeted my .. {guezt}.",
  ["npc.ztiss.multi_1"] = "Excellent! Now you may leave ziz area zrough ze teleporter to ze norz. It will bring you to a hidden boat. Ziz boat will take you to ze tournament izle. ...",
  ["npc.ztiss.multi_2"] = "Zere you'll learn anyzing you need to know about ze great tournament.",
  ["npc.ztiss.multi_3"] = "You are zmart for a zoftzkin, but before you begin to feel too zmart, you should know zat we will zeal our deal wiz you drinking a ztrong poizon zat will inevitably kill you if you want to trick me and not attend ze tournament. ...",
  ["npc.ztiss.multi_4"] = "Zo are you ready to drink ziz poizon here?",
  ["npc.ztiss.multi_5"] = "Zere iz a great tournament of ztrengz each decade. It determinez ze granted privilegez for zertain individualz of power for ze comming decade. ...",
  ["npc.ztiss.multi_6"] = "My mazter wantz to zurprize hiz opponentz by an unexpected move. He will uze warriorz from ze outzide, zomeone zat no one can azzezz. ...",
  ["npc.ztiss.multi_7"] = "One of ziz warriorz could be you. Or you could ztay here and rot in ze dungeon. Are you interezted in ziz deal?",
  ["npc.ztiss.multi_8"] = "Ziz iz not for you to azk. I work for zomeone of immenze power. He haz an {offer} for you.",
  ["npc.ztiss.say_1"] = "You are ztill a captive and your life is forfeit. Zere might be a way for you to ezcape if you agree to {work} for my mazter.",
  ["npc.zumtah.farewell_msg_1"] = "Muhahaha.",
  ["npc.zumtah.greet_msg_1"] = "Another visitor to this constricted, cosy, calm realm, perfect except for an {exit}. Muhaha.",
  ["npc.zumtah.multi_1"] = "Oh, excuse me of course, you... wanted to go. Like all... the others. I am sorry, so sorry. You... you can leave. Yes. You can go. You are free. I shall stay here and help every poor soul which ever gets thrown in here from this day onward. ...",
  ["npc.zumtah.multi_2"] = "Yes, I will redeem myself. Maybe in another 278 years. ...",
  ["npc.zumtah.multi_3"] = "If you want to go, just ask for an {exit} and I will transform you into a creature small enough to fit through that hole over there.",
  ["npc.zumtah.say_1"] = "You are searching for the way out? Do you want to go home? Are you homesick, nostalgic, allergic? I am sorry. You will stay. Muhahahaha. Haha. Are you giving up then?",
  ["npc.zumtah.say_10"] = "You are starting to get on my nerves. Is this the only topic you know?",
  ["npc.zumtah.say_11"] = "But there is no escape, I said NO. You've already asked several times and my answer will stay the same. What is this? Are you trying to test me?",
  ["npc.zumtah.say_12"] = "Muhahaha. Where? I can only see a dark cave with nothing than bones and a djinn in it. You mean that small hole there? Muhahaha.",
  ["npc.zumtah.say_13"] = "Pesky, persistent human.",
  ["npc.zumtah.say_14"] = "Muhahaha. Then I will give you a test. How many years do you think have I been here? {89}, {164} or {278}?",
  ["npc.zumtah.say_15"] = "Correct human, and that is not nearly how high you would need to count to tell all the lost souls I've seen dying here. I AM PERPETUAL. Muahahaha.",
  ["npc.zumtah.say_16"] = "Wrong answer human! Muahahaha.",
  ["npc.zumtah.say_2"] = "A what? I don't even know what you're talking about, human. If you aren't just giving up - will you kindly change the topic please?",
  ["npc.zumtah.say_3"] = "Haha, no! No. Why don't you just stop asking me that and start enjoying your stay here?",
  ["npc.zumtah.say_4"] = "Oh, you mean - if I have ever been out of here in those 278 years? Well, I - I can't remember. No, I can't remember. Sorry.",
  ["npc.zumtah.say_5"] = "No, I really can't remember. I enjoyed my stay here so much that I forgot how it looks outside of this hole. Outside. The air, the sky, the light. Oh well... well.",
  ["npc.zumtah.say_6"] = "Oh yes, yes. I... I never really thought about how you creatures feel in here I guess. I... just watched all these beings die here. ...",
  ["npc.zumtah.say_7"] = "Alright, as I said you are free now. There will not be an outside for the next three centuries, but you - go. ...",
  ["npc.zumtah.say_8"] = "It's you, why did they throw you in here again? Anyway, I will just transform you once more. I also recovered your crate which will wait for you at the exit. There, feel free to go.",
  ["npc.zumtah.say_9"] = "I've already told you that you can't get out. What's the problem? Do you even see an exit?",
  ["npc.zumtah.stdmod_1"] = "I wait. I wait for someone like you to come here. I wait for them to grow disconsolate. I wait for them to despair. And I wait for them to die. Muhahaha.",
  ["npc.zumtah.stdmod_2"] = "I am Zumtah, Zumtah the impeccable, Zumtah the marvellous, Zumtah the... the... eternal.",
  ["npc.zumtah.stdmod_3"] = "The land you are currently dwelling in, human. Don't you have any sense of your surroundings?",
  ["npc.zumtah.stdmod_4"] = "I have seen many of them. I have seen many of them die. In here, with me. Perhaps you will be pleased to meet them. Not long and you will join their ranks. Muhaha.",
  ["npc.zumtah.stdmod_5"] = "Pesky creatures. Many of them have been brought here, many of them died here. Humans, lizards, beasts, they all die the same. Down here, with me. Muhahaha.",
  ["npc.zumtah.stdmod_6"] = "What? What do you mean by that?",
  ["npc.zumtah.stdmod_7"] = "Hmm, an old one. I don't care much about politics or power, as here, he has none. Here, only I have power. Muhaha.",
  ["npc.zumtah.stdmod_8"] = "What are you talking about, such things do not matter down here. Down here alone, isolated and broken. Muhaha.",
  ["npc.zurak.say_1"] = "You want trip to Izzle of Zztrife?",
  ["npc.zurak.say_2"] = "You need permission to travel to.",
  ["npc.zurak.say_3"] = "It'zz your doom you travel to.",
  ["npc.zurak.say_4"] = "Zzoftzzkinzz zzo full of fear.",
  ["npc.zurak.say_5"] = "Me zzimple ferryman. I arrange {trip} to Izzle of Zztrife.",
  ["npc.zurak_arena.say_1"] = "You want trip to Izzle of Zzao?",
  ["npc.zurak_arena.say_2"] = "You need permission to travel to.",
  ["npc.zurak_arena.say_3"] = "It'zz done your travel to.",
  ["npc.zurak_arena.say_4"] = "Zzoftzzkinzz zzo full of fear.",
  ["npc.zurak_arena.say_5"] = "Me zzimple ferryman. I arrange {trip} to Zzao.",

